on?", "answer": "director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The release of One Night in Vegas was one of the largest turnouts ever in the history of Silverbird theater in a mall that was commissioned on July 4, 2008, and is owned by who?", "answer": "Atterbury Property Development, Sanlam and the Morladza family", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Where was the 37th annual draft of the National Basketball Association held, that an American retired professional basketball player who is currently the analyst on \"Inside the NBA\" was drafted as a junior by the Philadelphia 76ers?", "answer": "Felt Forum", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the official residence of the head of state of Germany?", "answer": "Schloss Bellevue", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What profession did Shaun Scott and F. Richard Jones share?", "answer": "director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Joey Hood worked for what American politician and author, who was also a Republican senator?", "answer": "Trent Lott", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is a flowering plant the tolerates sandy soil and low rainfall: Luma or Cowpea?", "answer": "cowpea", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The author of the 1981 book The Decline and Fall of the Roman Church was born in what year?", "answer": "1921", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What number was almost given to the U.S. Route that travels over the Cairo Mississippi Bridge?", "answer": "66", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 102 year old Golden Age actor both starred in a film considered an early precursor of steam-punk and made his film debut with Barbara Stanwyck?", "answer": "Kirk Douglas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Gymnocalycium and Haemanthus, are native to South America?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What date was Dont\u00e9 Dominic Greene drafted by the Memphis Grizzlies?", "answer": "June 26, 2008", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were both Max W. Kimmich and Henri-Georges Clouzot G