01 in North America?", "answer": "GameCube", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Elk River's headwaters end at which large stream of western North Carolina and East Tennessee?", "answer": "Watauga River", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which American astronaut, naval aviator, electrical engineer, aeronautical engineer, and fighter pilot landed north of Mackin?", "answer": "Eugene Cernan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sky and Sand is a song by German electronic music producers Paul Kalkbrenner and Fritz Kalkbrenner, the song was originally produced as the title song of which 2008 German tragicomedy directed by Hannes St\u00f6hr?", "answer": "Berlin Calling", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which  nineteenth-century art movement  was Francis Viel\u00e9-Griffin a poet of ", "answer": "Symbolism", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Rob Purdham was born in a market town with a populatin of what in 2011?", "answer": "8,194", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the character's name that Alistair Brammer and Hugh Jackman have both played in Les Miserables?", "answer": "Jean Prouvaire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of institution does Danny Watkins and 2010 Baylor Bears football team have in common?", "answer": "University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Did Georges Franju and Shane Meadows have the same nationality ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Playing a central role in American history, what famous theater was established in Boston, Massachusetts in 1845?", "answer": "Old Howard Theatre, in Boston, Massachusetts, was one of the most famous theaters in Boston history.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What award did Scarlett Johansson win from starring in the 2003 film \"Girl with a Pearl Earring\"?", "answer": "BAFTA Award", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was Chuang Chia-jung's partner in the 2010 MPS Group Championships \u2013 Doubles born?", "answer": "1986", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "By whom was 