lbum that includes the follow up of a German-language single at he Eurovision Song Contest 1979?", "answer": "Germany", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Premier League forward Dominic Calvert Levin scored the winning goal of the 2017 U20 World Cup for which country?", "answer": "England", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sir Andrew Wood of Largo died in 1515, while James III of Scotland dies before him in which year?", "answer": "1488", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which publishing company, owned by Random House, ranked Brave New World fifth on its list of the 100 best English-language novels of the 20th century?", "answer": "Modern Library", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birth date of this English actor, who has a twin nicknamed Tony?", "answer": "24 July 1947", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A star of \u201cAngel Eyes\u201d also starred in what television drama in 2007?", "answer": "The King And I\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Chief Justice who was born in 1777 delivered the majority opinion in the case 60 U.S. 393 in 1857 with a 7-2 decision?", "answer": "Roger B. Taney", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Dante's Inferno was led by which puppeteer, best known for his role as the title character on \"Beakman's World\"?", "answer": "Paul Finley Zaloom", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the Indian actor and politician who appeared in the movie \"Neenga Nalla Irukkanum\" as herself born?", "answer": "1948", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Hungry Howie's Pizza and Marco's Pizza both based in Ohio?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was the Opera singer that married Peter Greenough?", "answer": "Beverly Sills", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What profession was the father of the percussionist who has been accompanied by E .M. Subramaniam and who was awarded the Madras Music Academy's Sangeetha Kalanidhi in 2001?", "answer": "medical doctor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The album on which \"If You See Her, Say Hello\" is a song on was released on what date?", "answer": "January 20, 1975", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Zeybek is a youth exponent from Fenerbah\u00e7e, he made his S\u00fcper Lig debut at 31 May 2015 against Kas\u0131mpa\u015fa, he replaced who, which is a Turkish football midfielder who plays for \u0130stanbul Ba\u015fak\u015fehir?", "answer": "Emre Bel\u00f6zo\u011flu", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of the cast in \"Jennifa's Diary\" was born in Lagos State?", "answer": "Falz", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the film Do Ji-han was in that earned him a nomination for the Baeksang Arts Award for Best New Actor?", "answer": "Kim Ji-hoon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Kim Go-eun film was a South Korean martial arts/romance?", "answer": "Memories of the Sword", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What magazine company publishes Entertainment Weekly that also owns and publishes the Fortune magazine?", "answer": "Time Inc.", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The 1984 British Grand Prix was won by Niki Lauda, who was a three-time F1 World Drivers' Champion, winning in what 3 years?", "answer": "1975, 1977 and 1984", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of these two directors was born first, Michael Radford or Nicolas Cage?", "answer": "Michael Radford", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What island immigration station was within the Port of New York and New Jersey district?", "answer": "Ellis Island", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Man Down stars an actor known among younger audiences for his role as what character in \"Even Stevens\"?", "answer": "Louis Stevens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of the movie for which Jake Richardson was well known was  directed by Dean Cundey?", "answer": "Honey, We Shrunk Ourselves", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "James Robertson helped established the association that is in what modern-day town?", "answer": "Elizabethton, Tennessee", "type": "bridge"},