y Carly Simon?", "answer": "Pooh's Heffalump Movie", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was teacher of the composer of Faschingsschwank aus Wien? ", "answer": "Friedrich Wieck", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who were Joan Didion and Aleister Crowley?", "answer": "Aleister Crowley ( ; born Edward Alexander Crowley; 12 October 1875 \u2013 1 December 1947) was an English occultist, ceremonial magician, poet, painter, novelist, and mountaineer.", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Time Flies is a studio album, by American country music artist Billy Ray Cyrus, what is the name of his debut album?, ", "answer": "Some Gave All", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Vampire Academy, is a 2014 American fantasy comedy film based on Richelle Mead's 2007 best-selling novel of the same name, the film stars Lucy Fry, an Australian actress, and known for portraying who, in \"Lightning Point\"?", "answer": "Zoey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What act named Henry VIII \"Supreme Head\" of the Church in England?", "answer": "Act of Supremacy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Princess Maria Gabriella of Savoy, is the middle daughter of Italy's last king, Umberto II, and Marie Jos\u00e9 of Belgium, the \"May Queen\", and a sister of which pretender to their father's throne, the only son of Umberto II, the last King of Italy, and his wife, Marie-Jos\u00e9 of Belgium?", "answer": "Vittorio Emanuele of Savoy, Prince of Naples", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Adam Smith University was founded by Dr. Donald Grunewald, who was president of what college in Dobbs Ferry, New York?", "answer": "Mercy College", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What book came after The Sun Trail in the Warriors: Dawn of the Clans series written by Erin Hunter? Answer: Thunder Rising", "answer": "Thunder Rising", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Freeport, Maine is home to the tract of glacial silt that is of what measure?", "answer": "40 acre", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The European School, Munich 