ation?", "answer": "United States Department of Commerce", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Film is newer,  Follow Me, Boys! or Remember the Titans ?", "answer": "Remember the Titans is a 2000 American sports film", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the actor who plays Ahn Tae-pyung in Tomorrow Boy?", "answer": "South Korean", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were both Family Health and ROCKRGRL targeted to female audiences?  ", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which vocalist left the band whose fourth full-length album is Destroyer?", "answer": "Kristian Eivind Espedal", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Capcom game had Hiroki Takahashi voice it's character Ryu?", "answer": "Street Fighter", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Diarmait \u00d3 Conchobair was Prince of a province in what country?", "answer": "Ireland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Nike Flywire is a thread, composed of Vectran or nylon, and developed by which American multinational corporation that is engaged in the design, development, manufacturing, and worldwide marketing and sales of footwear, apparel, equipment, accessories, and services?", "answer": "Nike, Inc.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Earl of Donoughmore is a title in the Peerage of Ireland, his ancestors had long lived in the County Cork area as allies of the Mac C\u00e1rthaigh clan; they lost out during the times of Oliver Cromwell, an English military and political leader and later had which governmental position?", "answer": "Lord Protector of the Commonwealth of England, Scotland, and Ireland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which 1950 Western film, directed by Philip Ford, stars an American Actor and Professional Dog Breeder born in 1927?", "answer": "Redwood Forest Trail", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What movie did the American Actress and philanthropist, who had her breakout role in \"Tanner Hall\", also have a role in with Sunny Pawar?", "answer": "Lion", 