": "Ronald Ryan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which breed of dog has a disputed national origin, the Telomian or the Wirehaired Pointing Griffon?", "answer": "Wirehaired Pointing Griffon", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Andr\u00e9 Breton and Richard Ford of the same nationality?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is the director of the 1986 American teen comedy film in which Ben Stein plays an economics teacher?", "answer": "John Hughes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is a 1992 American horror comedy film directed and co-written by Sam Raimi, re-used a phrase by a fictional humanoid alien in the 1951 science fiction film \"The Day the Earth Stood Still\"", "answer": "Army of Darkness", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Peter Brown was the protagonist in the 1931 book that was illustrated by whom?", "answer": "John R. Neill", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the band who did the song \"Doc Holliday\" formed?", "answer": "2001", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Chiefs of Clan Mackay was once seated at the castle near what village?", "answer": "Tongue", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Denis Lamoureux wrote a book critical of Darwin along with which retired UC Berkeley professor?", "answer": "Phillip E. Johnson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The major American airline headquartered in Atlanta that serves Jackson Hole Airport operates over how many flights daily?", "answer": "5,400", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which director was politically motivated, Richard Pearce or Karel Kachy\u0148a?", "answer": "Karel Kachy\u0148a", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Rick Sylvester worked on the twelfth film in the James Bond series, which was the fifth to star what actor in the lead role?", "answer": "Roger Moore", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What did Naomi Snieckus portray in a 2010 American 3D horror film directed by Kevin Greutert?", "answer": "Nina", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ta Ra Rum 