nd DSJ class locomotive was first assembled by what company that produced diversified products like information technology and communications equipment and systems, electronic components and materials, power systems, industrial and social infrastructure systems, consumer electronics, household appliances, medical equipment, office equipment, as well as lighting and logistics.? ", "answer": "Toshiba Corporation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Liz Rose co-wrote the Taylor Swift song that was produced by whom?", "answer": "Nathan Chapman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born first, Ulrich Walter or Christer Fuglesang?", "answer": "Prof. Dr. Ulrich Hans Walter", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was the director of the lab that designed bombs for the project that used mass spectrometers to separate isotopes of uranium?", "answer": "Robert Oppenheimer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was formed farther east, The Ocean Blue or The Dandy Warhols", "answer": "The Ocean Blue", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which leader singer plays more musical instruments, Matt Shultz or Paul Roberts?", "answer": "Matthew Ray \"Matt\" Shultz", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Hans Multhopp worked at the Focke-Wulf Flugzeugbau AG with a designer born in which year ?", "answer": "1898", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which writer-director from Denmark directed a remake of Flatliners in 2017?", "answer": "Niels Arden Oplev", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The GBU-28 is a 5,000-pound laser-guided \"bunker busting\" bomb produced originally by an arsenal on the west bank of the Hudson River that has been what since 1966?", "answer": "National Historic Landmark", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which American focused on the realm of opposition to religion during the Golden Age of Freethought was parent to Jon Garth Murray?", "answer": "Madalyn Murray O'Hair", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Manuela Pfrunder was chosen by the Swiss National Bank to design the ninth series of what banknote that is issued in denominations of 10,20,50,100,200, and 1000?", "answer": "Banknotes of the Swiss franc", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Conchita Mart\u00ednez and Lucie Hradeck\u00e1 the same nationality?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which game was released first, Twilight Struggle or Diplomacy? ", "answer": "Twilight Struggle", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What team is now managed by the person who selected Scott Fox to be part of the national squad to face Norway in 2013?", "answer": "Scotland national team", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the stage name of a male actor starring in the Italian drama film 'Breath of Life?'", "answer": "Franco Nero", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "At Which film festival does Barry Keoghan starring The Killing of a Sacred Deer film won best screenplay award in 2017?", "answer": "Cannes Film Festival", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the capital of the district of Ghana containing Prestea?", "answer": "Aboso", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Would you find the Almond plant and Aloinopsis in alaska?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who has more scope of profession, Tilo Wolff or Adam Lazzara?", "answer": "Adam Burbank Lazzara", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "La fille du r\u00e9giment and Boris Godunov, are a what?", "answer": "opera", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Lewisia and Leucophyta, are a type of which specific entity?", "answer": "plant genus", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What two kickboxing organizations did the brother of Valentin Overeem hold titles in at the same time?", "answer": "MMA and K-1", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where are the headquarters of the organization through which Nedal Hussein has won the Asia Pacific super featherweight title?", "answer": "San Juan, Puerto Rico", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was a member of more bands, Ace Frehley or Daryl Palumbo?",