sh crime film, Information Received, which English actress that was born on 13 November 1906?", "answer": "Hermione Baddeley", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which rebel group has shown  support to The Sudan Revolutionary Front in an alliance against the 7th president of Sudan?", "answer": "Darfuri rebel groups for the Sudan People's Liberation Movement-North", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year did the grandfather of Abdulaziz Bin Turki Bin Talal Bin Abdulaziz Al Saud who was King of Saudi Arabia die?", "answer": "2015", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which American legal comedy-drama airing from 2004-2008 starred Emmy Award and Golden Globe winner, Candice Bergen?", "answer": "Boston Legal", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The XXXX Gold Beach Cricket Tri-Nations series is a competition of what?", "answer": "XXXX Gold is one of the many beers manufactured in the Australian state of Queensland by Castlemaine Perkins", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Shackleton is a 2001 British television film, written and directed by who, the film tells the true story of Shackleton's 1914 Antarctic expedition on the ship \"Endurance\", it was a three-masted barquentine?", "answer": "Charles Sturridge", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The star of An Eye for an Eye founded which school of fighting?", "answer": "Chun Kuk Do", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What possession was Chile and Argentina disputing that led to Operation Soberania?", "answer": "Picton, Lennox and Nueva islands", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "SN 1961V was first identified by a Swiss astronomer born in what year?", "answer": "1898", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were The Neighbourhood and Pierce the Veil formed in the same year?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who does the goalkeeper play for which Ahmad Khormali's tracksuit bottoms resemble?", "answer": "Szombathelyi Halad\u00e1s", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "when was the film released in which Jay Chou played