ond direct-to-video sequel to the 1950 Walt Disney Pictures animated classic \"Cinderella\", it features the voices of which Canadian-American voice actress best known for her work in video game franchises including \"Baldur's Gate\"?", "answer": "Jennifer Hale", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who wrote the he eighth episode of \"The Simpsons\"' first season which was Reverend Lovejoy first appearance", "answer": "Al Jean, Mike Reiss", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the first hit from the recording artist whose fifth studio album was titled \"Fortune\"?", "answer": "\"Run It!\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the third-largest Spanish city and the birthplace of the soprano Consuelo Mayend\u00eda?", "answer": "Valencia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Saint Amphibalus is a venerated early Christian priest said to have converted Saint Alban to Christianity, she was offered shelter by Saint Alban in the Roman city of Verulamium, in which modern-day country?", "answer": "England", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What position in the United States House of Representatives is served by the woman who appointed Brenda V.Smith?", "answer": "Minority Leader", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "From 2009 to 2013, what office was held by the candidate supported by Hookers for Hillary?", "answer": "United States Secretary of State", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "George Lowe was the voice of the main character on the show that was a spin-off of what variety show?", "answer": "Space Ghost Coast to Coast", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Transylvanian Hound and Irish Red and White Setter are both what?", "answer": "dog", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "ODB and Death From Above have which female wrestler in common?", "answer": "Jessica Kresa", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Macclesfield is being represented by the politician from which party?", "answer": "Conservative", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the head coach of the team which S