rish in the South Kesteven district of Lincolnshire, England?", "answer": "Long Bennington", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the name of the guerilla force that eventually challenged the rule of the Cuban dictator who was U.S.-backed from 1952 to 1959?", "answer": "\"Second National Front of the Escambray Mountains\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Dull Knive Battlefield was the scene of a battle that was fought on November 25, 1876 between sodiers and scouts of the United States Army and warriors of what?", "answer": "Northern Cheyenne", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which English actress started in Harry Brown and Match Point?", "answer": "Emily Mortimer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was 35th quadrennial presidential election, that had the Democratic nominee for Vice President who was the younger brother of Secretary of State William Jennings Bryan?", "answer": "presidential election of 1924", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Hartford Hawks women's basketball team plays in a conference whose members are located in which part of the United States ?", "answer": "the Northeastern United States", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who has more scope of profession, Frederick Wiseman or Marino Girolami?", "answer": "Frederick Wiseman", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "During what decade did J.R.R. Tolkien use mythopoeia in his literary works?", "answer": "1930s", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do David Ignatow and Bohumil Hrabal have the same nationality?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which restaurant chain has more locations: Hungry Howie's Pizza or East of Chicago Pizza?", "answer": "Hungry Howie's Pizza & Subs", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which Italian-American composer who wrote the classic Christmas opera \"Amahl and the Night Visitors\", had an American operatic mezzo-soprano and Broadway musical actress most known for originating the role of the Mother?", "answer": "Gian Carlo Menotti", "type": 