e rare plant Oreoxis humilis is only found, named after ?", "answer": "Zebulon Pike,", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the composer for the Orson Welles movie centred around Sir John Falstaff's father-son relationship with Prince Hal?", "answer": "Angelo Francesco Lavagnino", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did this American professional baseball pitcher playing for Nova Southeastern Sharks baseball pitch a no hitter? ", "answer": "on August 21, 2015", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "2013\u201314 Cincinnati Bearcats men's basketball team played in a league that was an offshoot of which conference that existed from 1979-2013?", "answer": "Big East Conference", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What new project is Taylor Hanson a part of?", "answer": "Tinted Windows", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the African-American woman that succeeded Catherine Waynick as bishop?", "answer": "Jennifer Baskerville-Burrows", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Rubberband is the debut album by which American country music singer and songwriter?", "answer": "Charlie Worsham", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is best known as a prolific screenwriter and director of low-budget Western films, Ginny Stikeman or Oliver Drake?", "answer": "Clarence Oliver Drake", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Graham Hamilton portrayed Fagin in a musical based on a novel by which author ?", "answer": "Charles Dickens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Royal Mausoleum of Hawaii held the remains of the first dynasty that was founded in what year?", "answer": "1795", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the pilot that joined Alexey Leonov on a 1965 space walk mission born?", "answer": "1925", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Name the college football coach, who most recently was the head coach at UNLV Rebels and who also had been head coach of the Montana Grizzlies for three years back in 2005?", "answer": "Bobby Hauck", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are The