ursing awards whatcertification for a doctoral program, other than a PhD?", "answer": "Doctor of Nursing Practice (DNP)", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "My Big Fat Independent Movie's direction, Chris Gore, also directed which 1996 omedy-drama film about the lives of single, unemployed actors living on the 'eastside' of Hollywood, California during the 1990s swing revival?", "answer": "Swingers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What German aircraft designed by Seiegfried and Walter G\u00fcnter at Heinkel Flugzeugwerke in 1934 was operated by Lehrgeschwader 1?", "answer": "Heinkel He 111", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was on CNBC and Fox News?", "answer": "Martha MacCallum", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the corporate sponsor of the Melbourne Park Multi-Purpose Venue based? ", "answer": "Qingdao, Shandong province, China", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What developer of Park Towers in Las Vegas has served as finance chair of the Republican National Committee?", "answer": "Steve Wynn", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Chronologie is a studio album inspired by a book published in what year?", "answer": "1988", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Viola Concerto was commissioned with contributions from the general interest family magazine founded in what year?", "answer": "1920", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Japanese fighter was the predecessor of the \"Reisen?\"", "answer": "The Mitsubishi A5M", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "From 1994 to 2009 Roger Jenkins worked for a multinational bank and financial services company headquartered in what city?", "answer": "London", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did the lead actor of Bollywood Queen make his acting debut?", "answer": "1995", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was drummer for Woody Herman and also cofounded the Blue Wisp Big Band?", "answer": "John Von Ohlen", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is one of the three landmarks located near the border in Colotado?", "answer":