 a Disney animated film", "answer": "The Princess and the Frog", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "\"Loan-a Lisa\" is the second episode of \"The Simpsons\"' twenty-second season, in the episode, Lisa helps fund Nelson's bicycle company with money given to her from which animated fictional character, as part of whose inheritance?", "answer": "Grampa Simpson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Wanda Jakubowska and Bill Duke both nationals of the same country ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "when will the third and final season of the  film in which Jacinda Barrett  join the main cast will be released ", "answer": "May 26, 2017", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was is the population of the place that is served in schooling by Eldwood Union Free School District?", "answer": "11,177", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Julia Kaye works on which upcoming Disney animated television series by Chris and Shane Houghton?", "answer": "Big City Greens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What award was given in 2014 to an actress who has sat for an interview with Marianne Schnall?", "answer": "American Film Institute AFI Life Achievement Award", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many parishes are there in the Archdiocese which has authority for The Polish Church of St. Adalbert ? ", "answer": "296", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Afghanistan Mission Network enabled an increased the perception of environmental elements and events with respect to time or space, the comprehension of their meaning, and the projection of their status after some variable has changed, such as time, or some other variable, such as a predetermined event, also known as?", "answer": "situational awareness", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which artist won a Grammy for a country song written by Paul Overstreet and Don Schlitz?", "answer": "Alison Krauss", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What NBA point guard attended a high school located on the south shore of Long