y whose Kansas City division anchors the Crown Center?", "answer": "Hallmark Cards", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lu'an and Xinmin, Liaoning, are located in which country?", "answer": "People's Republic of China", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what year was the second edition of the role playing game for which Ross Watson was the Lead Developer?", "answer": "2014", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What kind of mines are the Giant Mine and the Discovery Mine?", "answer": "gold mine", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which is breed of dog is recognized by more organizations: the Black and Tan Coonhound, the Rafeiro do Alentejo, or neither?", "answer": "Rafeiro do Alentejo", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Baseball Hall of Fame balloting for 2001 elected the player who is now special assistant to the executive director of what group?", "answer": "Major League Baseball Players Association", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were The Absent-Minded Professor and Lt. Robin Crusoe, U.S.N. made in the same year?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is the author of a children's history book that discusses a trade route that discusses a trade route that existed from the 16th to the 19th centuries?", "answer": "Arna Bontemps", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Richard Callaghan was the coach to the figure skater who won an Olympic gold in what year?", "answer": "1998", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was drafted by the Jacksonville Jaguars in 2013 that was back-up on 2009 Michigan football team?", "answer": "Denard Robinson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Is I Love You but I've Chosen Darkness or The Postal Service from further north?", "answer": "The Postal Service", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Franz Viehb\u00f6ck and Mark Shuttleworth both astronauts?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "When did the show premiere in which Fred Stoller played Gerard?", "answer": "September 13, 1996", "type": "b