: "Edward Heath", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of this single-vehicle car accident involving a US Senator and his companion, who was an American teacher, secretary, and political campaign specialist?", "answer": "Chappaquiddick incident", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Nonactin is a member of a family of naturally occurring cyclic ionophores known as the macrotetrolide antibiotics,Nonactin is soluble in methanol, dichloromethane, ethyl acetate and which is an organosulfur compound with the formula (CH)SO?", "answer": "DMSO", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What position does Sundar Pichai hold in Google?", "answer": "CEO", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What New Zealand director directs the American horror comedy television series Ash vs Evil Dead?", "answer": "Michael Eric Hurst", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Salvadoran beauty queen lost to Ximena Navarrete in the 2010 Miss Universe pageant?", "answer": "Sonia Yesenia Cruz Ayala", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the total surface area of the supercontinent where Tritheledontids have lived ?", "answer": "1000000 km2", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Toni Morrison and Nicholas Christopher both professor emerita at Princeton University?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What university made the biographer writer of one of the best known English literary figures of the latter half of the twentieth century Professor of Modern Literature?", "answer": "Metropolitan University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Derek Curtis Bok, is an American lawyer and educator and the former president of Harvard University, the cousin of which prominent Maine folklorist and singer-songwriter who grew up in Camden, Maine?", "answer": "Gordon Bok", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "I'll Sail My Ship Alone was re-recorded by which honky-tonk and rockabilly singer?", "answer": "Ferlin Eugene Husky", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "An American economist who serves as Und