ican rock band Queens of the Stone Age, released their fifth full length studio album, featuring the single Make It wit Chu, on what day?", "answer": "June 8, 2007", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is  Chokwe Lumumba's, the mayor elected of Jackson, Mississippi 0n June 4th, 2013, name at birth?", "answer": "Edwin Finley Taliaferro", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Eoin Lynch last played football for the team playing in what league?", "answer": "Premier Development League", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What city is located in the southeast part of Lithuania and has a football team?", "answer": "Vilnius", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What child of former U.S. President Bill Clinton presented the Amazing Young Women Award to online magazine Her Campus?", "answer": "Chelsea Clinton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which  list of hazardous waste sites in the United States was  Griffiss Air Force Base added to ", "answer": "The National Priorities List", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A wrestler whom is currently employed by Juggalo Championship Wrestling and is known for his hardcore wrestling style took part in a tag team match during St. Andrews Brawl, which match did he take part in? ", "answer": "main event match", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which author hosted the TV series \"Crowd Control\" after coining the term Free agent?", "answer": "Daniel H. Pink", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the nickname of the founder of Heaven's Gate?", "answer": "\"Bo\" and \"Do\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In their 72nd season this NBA team aquired an American professional basketball player who was named NBA Rookie of the Year in what year?", "answer": "2011", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the character played by the star of the show Jane the Virgin?", "answer": "Jane Villanueva", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "George Szamuely has written for what monthly American magazine focusing on religion, Judiasm, and politics?