. Brown, You've Got a Lovely Daughter\"?", "answer": "Norman Thaddeus Vane", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Tina Turner, the American-born singer of the live album Tina Live, obtained what citizenship in 2013?", "answer": "Swiss citizenship", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which lake near the High Still ridge is owned by the National Trust?", "answer": "Buttermere", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which former American football quarterback who earned a Super Bowl Ring with the Rams currently serves as an NFL on CBS sideline reporter alongside Jamie Erdahl and Greg Gumbel?", "answer": "Trent Green", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is considered a post hard-hardcore band, Fightstar or The Coral Sea?", "answer": "Fightstar", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Whos interviews inspired the 2015 film London Road and was responsible for the murders of five women?", "answer": "Steve Wright", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what building was the constitution that preceded the Leocompton Constitution drafted?", "answer": "Constitution Hall", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sun Hung Kai & Co is a financial services firm with a focus on what Region that includes  Mainland China, Hong Kong, Macau and Taiwan", "answer": "Greater China", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What American drummer, best known for his work with P-Funk, worked with a funk band led by George Clinton?", "answer": "Jerome Eugene \"Bigfoot\" Brailey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Robert Stevenson and Am Rong a filmmaker?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What nationality are both Ingmar Bergman and Geir Hansteen J\u00f6rgensen?", "answer": "Swedish", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which English recording artist born in 1985 co-wrote songs on the debut album DNA of the British girl group Little Mix?", "answer": "Nicola Roberts", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which retired American professional tennis player was defualted in a 1999 match for swear