ical groups?", "answer": "Lollapalooza", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Benjamin Hanby composed what song that originated with a poem by Emily Huntington Miller?", "answer": "Jolly Old Saint Nicholas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lei Day celebrates an object that is a type of what?", "answer": "garland or wreath", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who hosted the event where Dana Abilda competed in 2015 in Denmark?", "answer": "the International Handball Federation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Martinus R\u00f8rbye was a painter during a period of exception creative production in which country?", "answer": "Denmark", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Radisson Royal Dubai is a skyscraper that houses a hotel company that is a subsidiary of which group ?", "answer": "the Carlson Rezidor Hotel Group", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born first, American novelist Tom Robbins or marine biologist Rachel Carson?", "answer": "Rachel Louise Carson", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": " What company publishes the campaign setting in which Kel\u00e9stia Productions produces materials for?", "answer": "Columbia Games", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Sean Anders directed film stars Will Ferrell and former Marky Mark and the Funky Bunch frontman Mark Wahlberg?", "answer": "Daddy's Home", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where did the hurricane, that severely affected Montebello, Virginia in 1969, make landfall in the US on August 18th ?", "answer": "Waveland, Mississippi", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Did the New York Times Co. v. Sullivan case or Dusky v. United States come first?", "answer": "Dusky v. United States", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The 2015\u201316 Lipscomb Bisons women's basketball team were members of a conference that is headquartered where?", "answer": "Macon, Georgia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the 2017 romantic comedy film co-written by Emily V. Gordon?", "answer": "Michael Showalter", "type": "bridge"