t was created by Jonny Belt and Robert Scull, and was produced for who?", "answer": "Nickelodeon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 2013 South Korean action film starring Shin Ha-kyun had Oh Jung-se appear in an onscreen supporting role?", "answer": "Running Man", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the title track about from U2's album that Apple CEO Tim Cook marketed as \"the largest album release of all time\"?", "answer": "Joey Ramone", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Dance of the Drunk Mantis is a 1979 Hong Kong kung fu comedy film directed by Yuen Siu-tien's real life son Yuen Woo-ping, this was Yuen Siu-tien's final film appearance before his death on 8 January 1979 from a heart attack, Myocardial infarction (MI), commonly known as a heart attack, occurs when blood flow decreases or stops to a part of the heart, causing damage to what?", "answer": "heart muscle", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jeffry Fortes is a Dutch-born professional footballer who currently plays as a defensive midfielder for a football club founded on what date?", "answer": "23 July 1902", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Rebus starred a Swedish-American actress who has won five Golden Globe Awards, and been nominated for how many Academy Awards?", "answer": "two", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of the Big Four auditors helped bring about a merger between South Kent College and West Kent College?", "answer": "KPMG", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The English crime Minette Walter wrote what 2007 novel?", "answer": "The Chameleon's Shadow", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Saturday Night Live Alumni starred in the 2001 Canadian/American/French romantic comedy Speaking of Sex?", "answer": "Bill Murray", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which movie about a group of war pigeons in World War II was Pip Torrens in?", "answer": "Valiant", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which boxer, who is ranked by BoxRec as the best British light-welterweight of all time, knocked out boxer Michael Stewart?", "answer": "Ricky Hatton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Fading\" is a song by Barbadian recording artist Rihanna, some critics also compared it to which one of Rihanna's previous singles,which song recorded by Barbadian singer Rihanna for the re-release of her third studio album \"Good Girl Gone Bad\" (2007?", "answer": "Take a Bow", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What band  consists of lead vocalist and guitarist Jon Fratelli , bass guitarist Barry Fratelli , and drummer and backing vocalist Mince Fratelli that released their third single from their second album \"Here We Stand\", released on 22 December 2008? ", "answer": "The Fratellis", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jatz is typically eaten with a black spread created in what year?", "answer": "1922", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " John Fowler & Co produced a tracked version of a brand of what?", "answer": "farm tractor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were Edward Laemmle and Jan \u0160vankmajer from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What grade II listed railway station services a village in the South Lakeland district of Cumbria, England?", "answer": "Dent railway station", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What park is acknowledged as the first publicly funded civic park in the world that the Laird School of Art overlooked? ", "answer": "Birkenhead Park", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Destiny and A Village Romeo and Juliet, is what type of play?", "answer": "opera", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the actor that played Young Tom Morris in a 2016 historical drama film?", "answer": "Scottish", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bernadette Flynn was a dancer in the style that took its influence from what French style?", "answer": "quadrilles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Revolutionary Democratic Front is a populist party in El Salvador, whom often accuse  which two groups as unfairly dominating