amie Lassiter played college football for which Big 12 team?", "answer": "Kansas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the second EP for \u30c8\u30a5\u30ef\u30a4\u30b9?", "answer": "Page Two", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what month of 1956 was the event that caused The Clean Air Act as a response?", "answer": "December", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What state was the US Representative from that served on the House Oversight and Government Reform Committee?", "answer": "California", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the play written that Shylock is based on?", "answer": "between 1596 and 1599", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Conquering Dystopia is an instrumental metal supergroup founded by Keith Merrow and a former Nevermore guitarist born in what year? ", "answer": "1971", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What county in Maryland has a town that began as a streetcar suburb northeast of Washington D.C.?", "answer": "Prince George's County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Wrestlers is a grade II listed public house on on a read linking between which cities ?", "answer": "London, York and Edinburgh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Choisya and Oenothera endemic to the Americas ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What did the technical device made by the british aeronautical engineer during the second world war do? ", "answer": "counter engine cut-out", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who represents a village in the southwest part of the town of Greenburgh in the New York state Senate?", "answer": "Andrea Stewart-Cousins", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Christopher Mitchell starred in a film based on a novel by what author?", "answer": "Hunter Davies", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which documentary took place first, The Man Who Skied Down Everest or Dont Look Back", "answer": "The Man Who Skied Down Everest", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Roberta Flack had a #1 single with the song composed 