, but when was Dead Space 3 re;esed internationally?", "answer": "February 2013", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the legendary drummer born who was part of \"Hymn for My Soul\", the twentieth studio album by Joe Cocker, released in 2007?", "answer": "April 27, 1942", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2011 USA Sevens competition was held at a football stadium with an elevation how many feet above sea level?", "answer": "1600", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which band would be classified as Christian nu metal, P.O.D. or Swervedriver?", "answer": "P.O.D.", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "what song is in the movie directed by Paul Hoen based on the novel \"if I had one wish\"?", "answer": "\"World of Our Own\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Edward Harrison Norton has done uncredited work on the script for the second film in what?", "answer": "the Marvel Cinematic Universe", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who wrote the opera in which Lalla Miranda appeared in as Olympia?", "answer": "Jacques Offenbach", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bob Gale co-wrote famously a movie starring Michael J. Fox was which character?", "answer": "Marty McFly", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "With what American physicist born February 28, 1948, did William Daniel Phillips share his Nobel Prize in Physics in 1997?", "answer": "Steven Chu", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Perry Farrell's album Song Yet to Be Sung features collaborations with which Dutch bassist and founder of Porno for Pyros?", "answer": "Martyn LeNoble", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Here Comes My Girl was an early hit for the best known of Tom Petty's bands, in which year?", "answer": "1979", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sia recorded a song \"the greatest\" that went in her seventh studio album called what?", "answer": "This Is Acting", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Danish-Italian actress played a returning role in 1996 film Fantaghir\u00f2 5?", "answer": "Brigitte Nielsen", "type