mpilation album called Rock 'N Roll Music by what musical artist?", "answer": "The Beatles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "what does Tongshanjiabu and Changtse have in common?", "answer": "mountain", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What occupation was shared by Rudolph Polk and Joseph Santley?", "answer": "director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What company formed Son Seung-wan's girl group?", "answer": "S.M. Entertainment", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of publication does Never Say Die and Anthony Horowitz have in common?", "answer": "novel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the library tower, named for former long-time head librarian of the Georgia Tech Library?", "answer": "Dorothy M. Crosland Tower", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "John Munson was bass player for the band formed in which Minnesota city in 1995?", "answer": "Minneapolis", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Averroes was a philosopher under which philosophical movements  such as Aristotelianism and the 13th-century philosophical movement  came into play in what other religions beside Islam?", "answer": "Christian and Jewish", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Afterburn starred the American actress who was nominated for an Academy Award for which 1991 film?", "answer": "Rambling Rose", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A Best Actor Golden Globe nominee played in a 1999 film that was a modernization of what late-16th century William Shakespeare comedy?", "answer": "The Taming of the Shrew", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In December 2012 the Mexican professional wrestling promotion Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre Co., Ltd, is a \"lucha libre\" professional wrestling promotion based in Mexico City, will hold how many CMLL Super Viernes shows?", "answer": "four", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What location is common to Kn\u00fdtlinga saga and Cnut the Great?", "answer": "Denmark", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who served in the United States House 