se?", "answer": "34-year", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Is the University of Maryland, College Park or University of South Carolina further north?", "answer": "The University of Maryland, College Park", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which Armenian was also American, Konstantin Orbelyan or Haig P. Manoogian?", "answer": "Haig Manoogian", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Where was the 1979 rock trio formed that was named as an homage to extraterrestrials?", "answer": "Mendoza", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What structure dates back to 1502 and its 10th laird was a Scottish Politician known for the Montgomery Plot?", "answer": "Skelmorlie Castle", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was Chinese born, Gregory Nava or King Hu?", "answer": "King Hu", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What banned formed in Olympia, Washington headlined the Decibelle music and cultural festival?", "answer": "Gossip", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which county does this city where the radio station KLEY is located belong?", "answer": "Sumner County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Mexican banda music singer Valent\u00edn Elizalde had songs that eulogized which Mexican suspected drug lord based in Chihuahua?", "answer": "Vicente Carrillo Fuentes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This 18-story industrial building faces the entrance to a tunnel under what river?", "answer": "Hudson River", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did the English astronomer born in 1618 demonstrate that the moon moved around the earth?", "answer": "4 December", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was Cory James Weston's NXT Tag Team Champion wrestling partner born?  ", "answer": "1988", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "For which Minneapolis-St. Paul area sports team did Zenon Konopka play? ", "answer": "Minnesota Wild", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do Ishmael Bernal and Charles Vidor have the same nationality?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the