, she wrote a biography of which Sudeten German-born woman, who, with her husband Oskar Schindler, helped to save the lives of 1,200 to 1,700 Jews during World War II by employing them,  providing them immunity from the Nazis?", "answer": "Emilie Schindler", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Wicksteed Park is an amusement park in Kettering, Northamptonshire, England, it's the second oldest theme park in the UK; the oldest is which amusement park, on the Isle of Wight?", "answer": "Blackgang Chine", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Oscar Polk played a memorable scene with which actress in Gone with the Wind?", "answer": "Vivien Leigh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Damn Good Dog is a documentary film, released in what year, detailing the history of the Uga dynasty, Uga , is the official live mascot of the University of Georgia Bulldogs, since 1956, all the dogs serving as Uga have been part of a lineage of English Bulldogs, owned by who?", "answer": "Sonny Seiler", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What hotel currently stands on the former site of Rouvaun's stage appearance on February 5, 1967?", "answer": "Bellagio", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jung Sung-il placed 17th at the Winter Olympics figure stating competition that was held at what Olympic Amphitheatere?", "answer": "Hamar", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When Harry Shorstein was appointed as attorney by Lawton Chiles, which state did they both serve?", "answer": "Florida", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " East Karelian concentration camps were organized by a Finnish military leader who served as commander-in-chief of Finland's defence forces during what war?", "answer": "World War II", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who coached a figure skater who won the 2008 World bronze medal?", "answer": "Galina Yakovlevna Zmievskaya", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many people are employed by the company owned by the world's youngest billionaire?", "answer": "37", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do fi