am?", "answer": "Carlos Ortiz", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who produced the animated mystery comedy television series for which Indira Stefanianna originally voiced the character Daphne Blake?", "answer": "Hanna-Barbera", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "American Airlines Flight 11 was flying away from the airport in what major city?", "answer": "Boston", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Charlie Bryan (11 December 1933 - 2 November 2013) was the head of the International Association of Machinists union in the southeast United States, during the mid to late 1980s, in 1989, he led machinists to strike against Eastern Air Lines and which American businessman and philanthropist, born on May 19, 1940?", "answer": "Francisco Anthony \"Frank\" Lorenzo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Did Jim Pugh and Murphy Jensen both date actress Robin Givens?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Branch Wars is the tenth episode of the fourth season of The Office, and marks the return of an American actress who is widely known for playing Ann Perkins on what NBC comedy?", "answer": "Parks and Recreation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "NASA's Story is a documentary series by Dangerous Films for the BBC to commemorate 50 years since the formation of NASA, the show includes various interviews with astronauts and NASA personnel such as which American engineer and former astronaut, he was one of the first two humans to land on the Moon, and the second person to walk on it?", "answer": "Buzz Aldrin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Our First President's Quickstep celebrated the President of the Confederate States during what time?", "answer": "1861 to 1865", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The airline featured in \"Bombing Hitler's Dams\" is based in which country? ", "answer": "Canada", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What series developed by Rob Thomas stars Mercy Malick?", "answer": "iZombie", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The name of the ancient region Ed