ilm Manderlay?", "answer": "Nicole Kidman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Afghanistan's Ministry of Foreign Affairs is headed by Salahuddin Rabbani, an Afghan diplomat and politician who was Minister of Foreign Affairs of Afghanistan during what time period? ", "answer": "February 2015 to June 2017", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which founder of the Saratoga and Schenectady Railroad was a judge, early landowner, and hotel owner?", "answer": "Henry Walton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What metropolitan area is Creative Planning, Inc headquartered at?", "answer": "Kansas City metropolitan area", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What are some shows and films Krystal Jung has been in ", "answer": "Aside from group activities, she has also participated in various television dramas such as \"\" (2011\u201312), \"The Heirs\" (2013), \"My Lovely Girl\" (2014), and \"The Bride of Habaek\" (2017).", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Bruce Dellis and Gene Kelly both in the entertainment industry?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "the station WIWU-CD is owned by a university that is public or private ?", "answer": "private", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "King Kong created in 1933 has been the inspiration for countless series\u2019 what was the name of the American-Canadian television series aired in 2000 featuring him?", "answer": "Kong: The Animated Series", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of the actors that starred in \"The Bride of Habaek\" was born in February 22, 1994?", "answer": "Nam Joo-hyuk", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What animal with only four extant species was the name borne by four ships of the Royal Navy", "answer": "Hyena", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the architect of the IBM Somers Office Complex?", "answer": "Chinese American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The man known for trying to prove the innocence of Sirhan Sirhan in the assassination of Robert F. Kennedy is also kno