 the last King of Italy?", "answer": "Queen Marie Jos\u00e9", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lincolnshire Fire and Rescue (LFR) is the statutory fire and rescue service serving the non-metropolitan county of Lincolnshire, North Lincolnshire and North East Lincolnshire, which are covered by Humberside Fire and Rescue Service, is the statutory fire and rescue service covering the area of what was the county of Humberside (1974\u20131996), but now consists of the unitary authorities of East Riding of Yorkshire, Kingston upon Hull, North Lincolnshire and North East Lincolnshire in which location?", "answer": "northern England", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Eleanora Ehrenberg stared in what opera that was first performed at the Provisional Theatre, Prague in 1866?", "answer": "The Bartered Bride", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What regular panellist on the game show \"A League of Their Own\" also edited the magazine \"The Heretick\"?", "answer": "Jack Whitehall", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Grestest Love Songs of All Time came out just before Barry Manilow started to play at a hotel owned by who?", "answer": "Caesars Entertainment Corporation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which publication Woman's Journal or Woman's Era was initially published more often ?", "answer": "Woman's Journal", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is known primarily as a horror film director, his earlier works were Westerns, dramas and adventure films, Jorge Fons or Jos\u00e9 Mojica Marins ?", "answer": "Jos\u00e9 Mojica Marins", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which Opera has more acts Les v\u00eapres siciliennes and La scala di seta ?", "answer": "Les v\u00eapres siciliennes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Eric Jay was senior chaplain to which Archbishop of Canterbury, who served from 1945 to 1961?", "answer": "Geoffrey Francis Fisher", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Panic is a 2000 American crime film that starred what actor who was best known for his 