ore to an animated film released by who?", "answer": "Walt Disney Pictures", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This arcade, located near Stockland Glasshouse, was one of the first Victorian buildings in Sydney?", "answer": "The Strand Arcade", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Dream Dancing is a song first recorded on Decca Records in American in 1941, for the film \"You'll Never Get Rich,\" by who?", "answer": "Fred Astaire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actor who played Sherlock Holmes in the television film Sherlock Holmes and the Case of the Silk Stocking received his first Golden Globe Award nomination for his role in what movie?", "answer": "My Best Friend's Wedding", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What pitch was Lucy Mander's co-star in Doctor Zhivago trained to sing in?", "answer": "baritone", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Wayne County, Michigan district did Hansen Clarke represent  as a member of the United States House of Representatives?", "answer": "Michigan's 13th congressional district", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the creator of a \"The Sandman\" spin-off?", "answer": "Mike Carey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The film The illustrated Man is based upon a science fiction short story, which was published in 1951 by what author?", "answer": "Ray Bradbury", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What college did Nick Barnett go to and was the first organized football team in 1893?", "answer": "Oregon State University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Split Second is a 1992 American-British science fiction horror film starring an English-Canadian actress known for her role as Samantha Jones in what HBO romantic comedy series?", "answer": "Sex and the City", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Robert Justus Kleberg was a veteran of a 1836 battle led by what general?", "answer": "General Sam Houston", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What nationality is the creator of the film More ?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"questi