tion": "As of which earthly date do the Jehovah's Witnesses believe that Jesus Christ has been ruling in heaven as king, a date they believe was prophesied in Scripture, resulting in God's selection of Bible Students associated with the early 20th century Christian restorationist minister from Pittsburgh and founder?", "answer": "1914", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which painter of 'Irises' was self admitted to Saint Saint-Paul asylum in Saint-R\u00e9my-de-Provence in 1889?", "answer": "Vincent van Gogh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which ongoing black-and-white comic book series by Robert Kirkman inspire the post-apocalyptic horror television series starring Andrew Lincoln?", "answer": "The Walking Dead", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Joyce Carol Oates and Terence Rattigan both published writers ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which of the following writers or authors also hosted a television series, Rachel Carson or Arthur C. Clarke?", "answer": "Sir Arthur Charles Clarke", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Actor, Michael Rooker, who also plays Merle Dixon in \"The Walking Dead\" starred in Guardians of the Galaxy a film based on what?", "answer": "Marvel Comics superhero team", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The co-writer of the song \"Firework\" also wrote which song by singer Chris Brown?", "answer": "\"Drop It Low\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Uwharrie National Forest is managed together with what other North Carolina forest, established in 1920 and comes from a Cherokee word meaning \"Land of the Noonday Sun\"?", "answer": "Nantahala", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Charlie Day is well known for his role as Dale in comdey movie that was directed by what person?", "answer": "Seth Gordon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Was Karel Reisz or Jorge Fons Perez born first?", "answer": "Karel Reisz", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the nationality of the person Jansen was named after?", "answer": 