ecial appearance by Asha Patel?", "answer": "Kaho Naa... Pyaar Hai", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Liz Rose, is an American country music songwriter best known for her work with Taylor Swift, and  has co-written twenty of Swift's officially-released songs and singles, including which song was written by Swift and Liz Rose and produced by Nathan Chapman, with Swift's aid?", "answer": "White Horse", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Joe O'Connor plays Marshall Darling in a tv series created by who?", "answer": "Mitchell Kriegman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who acquired the publishing rights to the recent bestselling erotic romantic trilogy by Erika Mitchell?", "answer": "Vintage Books", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Shadow Child was first published in 1987, but was later published in 1998 by what publisher in Lebanon, New Hampshire that was founded in 1970?", "answer": "The University Press of New England", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "According to the 2010 census, what was the population of the CDP in which Happehatchee Center is located?", "answer": "18,176", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Claims that its bladeless fans produce a more constant airflow than traditional fans were made by a company that employs more than how many people worldwide?", "answer": "7,000", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the Afghan politician who serves as governor of a multi-ethnic and mostly rural province of Afghanistan with a population of about 631,600?", "answer": "Mohammad Asim Asim", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the middle name of the star of the upcoming comedy film Night School ?", "answer": "Darnell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the person who designed Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge's wedding dress born?", "answer": "1974", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Link richness is the quality, possessed by some websites, of having many hyperlinks, classified advertising sites like Craigslist, of which nationality?", "answer": "Ame