ording to the 2010 census what was the population of the town which Free Jim Mine is located?", "answer": "5,242", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where does Footy Classified, hosted by Craig Hutchison, broadcast?", "answer": "Australian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Pure Imagination\" was a cover version sung by Fiano Apple which was oroginally performed by Gene Wilder as Willy Wonka from the adaptation of the children's novel which came out in what year?", "answer": "1964", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the profession of JC Chasez and Annie Lennox?", "answer": "singer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How long is the river which University Oval, Adelaide is located on?", "answer": "85 km", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Aniak Airport and Valdosta Regional Airport, are which type of airport?", "answer": "public use", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Did English writer, Alan Moore, or French author, Jean Giono, use more pseudonyms?", "answer": "Alan Moore", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Vanjari Hound and Chien-gris names of dog breeds?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Michael Foale and Jean-Jacques Favier, have which job in common?", "answer": "astronaut", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Cedars of Lebanon was the final track from which twelfth U2 studio album, released in 2009?", "answer": "No Line on the Horizon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Social Contract is a book which Jean-Jacques Rousseau identified in which earlier book?", "answer": "Discourse on Inequality", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Anna Howard Shaw Day starred the actor, director, and producer who was best known for playing what character on Mad Men?", "answer": "Don Draper", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Kickboxer 4: The Aggressor is a 1994 direct-to-video release martial-arts film, directed by which American film director best known for having made many low-budget B-movies and direct-to-video action films?", "answer"