n actor that plays in Predicament that is  comedian, actor, voice actor, singer, writer, director, and multi-instrumentalist from?", "answer": "New Zealand", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who coined the name used for the arts movement, with whose members Lotti van der Gsag was strongly associated ?", "answer": "Christian Dotremont", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Red Granite Pictures is an American film production and distribution company, co-founded, in 2010, by Riza Aziz, and which American film producer, and co-founder and vice chairman?", "answer": "Joey McFarland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Red Paintings album Feed the Wolf included \"Sing\" a cover song that was originally sang by a band who discribed their style as what?", "answer": "Brechtian punk cabaret", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the name of the punk house which served as the home base for Lou Reed's band?", "answer": "The Factory", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born earlier, Wilfred Lucas or Shinya Tsukamoto?", "answer": "Wilfred Lucas", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Quarto and Monopoly are both what?", "answer": "board game", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Lee Yeon-hee (; born January 9, 1988) is a South Korean actress, known for her work in which 2006 South Korean romance film directed by Kim Tae-kyun, starring Hyun Bin and Lee Yeon-hee?", "answer": "A Millionaire's First Love", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Naomi and Ely's No Kiss List is a 2015 American romantic comedy-drama film, it is based on the 2007 book of the same name by David Levithan, an American young adult fiction author and editor, his first book was ?", "answer": "Boy Meets Boy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the team coach Panathinaikos born who was appointed on 13 June 2008?", "answer": "9 December 1954", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In addition to his role as Francis Gary Powers in Bridges of Spies, Austin Stowell also played in which movie in 2014?", "answer"