ty?", "answer": "New Hampshire Democratic Party", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What clothing company has sponsored the alternative rock band Anberlin?", "answer": "Heartcore Clothing", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "BC Mid North Coast is an ABC Local Radio station based in Port Macquarie, this includes the towns and cities of Coffs Harbour, Taree, and Kempsey, a town in the Mid North Coast region of New South Wales, in which country?", "answer": "Australia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Is it true that Stephan Elliott and Emile Ardolino were film directors?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Modern Drummer and Entertainment Weekly are both what?", "answer": "magazine", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What kind of music do Suede and I Mother Earth play?", "answer": "alternative rock", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Everybody Draw Mohammed Day (or \"Draw Mohammed Day\") was a 2010 event in support of artists threatened with violence for drawing representations of the Islamic prophet Muhammad, it stemmed from a protest against censorship of the American television show \"South Park\" which specific episode, in response to death threats that had been made against some of those responsible for two segments broadcast, in which episode, a superhero-like group of religious figures team up to save South Park from the celebrities and their monster Mecha-Streisand, while Eric Cartman learns the true identity of his father?", "answer": "201", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The English navigator and cartographer, who was the leader of the first circumnavigation of Australia and identified it as a continent, named an island in 1802 in which gulf?", "answer": "Spencer Gulf", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both rock bands Tapes 'n Tapes and Sloan based in Minneapolis, Minnesota?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Arbutus and Castanospermum both native to Australia?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"q