ion": "Which film came out first, Hercules or The Cat from Outer Space?", "answer": "The Cat from Outer Space", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which year was the oldest brother born out of Yoan Pablo Hern\u00e1ndez Su\u00e1rez and Yoel Romero?", "answer": "1977", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the net worth of the inventor of the Swift Boat Challenge?", "answer": "$500 million", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Piptanthus and Rice both legumes?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the Cowboys' record the first season under a coach who later became a broadcaster and executive?", "answer": "7\u20135", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of this African American Messman Third Class of the United States Navy who was awarded great honors for his bravery during the attack on Pearl Harbor and for whom a park is dedicated in his honor close to the Waco Suspension Bridge?", "answer": "Doris D. Miller", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What date did the 78th episode of the American adult animated sitcom created by Trey Parker and Matt Stone air?", "answer": "December 5, 2001", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Primitives and Razorlight, have which shared genre?", "answer": "indie", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the birthdate of this Canadian actress, who won a Canadian Screen Award nomination and starred in Tully?", "answer": "April 1, 1987", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Is Vahe Aghabegians or Seth Rollins older?", "answer": "Vahe Aghabegians", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which film was created first, Around the World in 80 Days or The Adventures of Ichabod and Mr. Toad?", "answer": "The Adventures of Ichabod and Mr. Toad", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Arif Erdem, is a retired Turkish international footballer of Albanian descent and the former manager of \u0130stanbul B\u00fcy\u00fck\u015fehir Belediyespor, he scored 106 goals in 341 league matches and finished joint top scorer