ectual properties include what third-person shooter video game developed by Remedy Entertainment?", "answer": "Max Payne", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Orion Nebula, is a diffuse nebula situated in the Milky Way, being south of Orion's Belt, also known as the Three Kings or Three Sisters, is an asterism in the constellation Orion, and consists of how many bright stars?", "answer": "three", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "what superhero had an adversary who's birthplace is a fictional country appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics, the adversary first appeared in \"Batman: Vengeance of Bane\"  ?", "answer": "Batman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of animal does Old Time Farm Shepherd and Portuguese Podengo have in common?", "answer": "dog", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Norwood is a suburb of Adelaide, about 4 km east of the Adelaide city centre, the suburb is in which metropolitan local government area of South Australia, and it is divided into five wards?", "answer": "City of Norwood Payneham & St Peters", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lynx Casino has what game in it that make wagers on the outcome of the roll of a pair of dice?", "answer": "Craps", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jos\u00e9 Ignacio Ceniceros Gonz\u00e1lez, (born May 11, 1956) is a Spanish politician and member of which conservative and Christian democratic political party, in Spain?", "answer": "People's Party", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Tennis and PC Gamer the same kind of publication?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The William G. and Retha Stone Baker Observatory is an astronomical observatory owned and operated by Missouri State University, (MSU or MO State), formerly Southwest Missouri State University, is a public university located in which city, in Missouri, United States?", "answer": "Springfield", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Fantasista is a song named after which player from J\u00fabilo Iwata?", "an