d on February 7, 2004?", "answer": "EuroMillions", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Frank Myers Field host a college baseball team who's official color is what color?", "answer": "Royal Purple", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What did the Anglo-Saxons fail to prevent during the battle which inspired the J.R.R. Tolkien work The Homecoming of Beorhtnoth Beorhthelm's Son?", "answer": "Viking invasion", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Utimuni was a warrior of the Zulu tribe and nephew of a king born in what year?", "answer": "1787", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which alternative rock group was from Canada, 54-40 or Royal Trux?", "answer": "54-40", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which star of Now You See Me 2 was born on July 23, 1961 ?", "answer": "Woody Harrelson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The First Lady of the United States from 1981 to 1989 co-starred with George Murphy in a 1952 film directed by who?", "answer": "David Bradley", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sid Haig had a role in the exploitation horror film released in what year?", "answer": "2003", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which courtier did Empress Elisabeth of Austria suspect of being a spy, in part because she was a confident to the identical twin sister of Princess Maria Anna of Bavaria?", "answer": "Sophie Esterh\u00e1zy-Liechtenstein", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do Emma Bull and Edgar Rice Burroughs write at least one of the same genres?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "For which team in the National Hockey League does this Canadian professional ice hockey defenceman, who was named top defenceman during the 2008 IIHF World Championship, play currently?", "answer": "San Jose Sharks", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Edward J. Nately III is a character in a Joseph Heller novel that was first published in what year? ", "answer": "1961", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Everglades & Dry Tortugas Biosphere Reserve encompasses Everglades National Pa