 Patterson was the head coach of until March 9, 2014 compete in?", "answer": "Big 12 Conference", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the university where Thomas R. Insel was Director of the Center for Behavioral Neuroscience founded?", "answer": "1836", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which astronaut is older, Philippe Perrin or Claude Nicollier?", "answer": "Claude Nicollier", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Mario C\u00e1rdenas Guill\u00e9n is the brother of the Mexican drug lord who was the former leader of what group?", "answer": "Gulf Cartel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Students from what three towns attend Freeport High School and are close to Wolfe's Neck Park?", "answer": "Durham, and Pownal.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What profession does PJ Harvey and The Last Shadow Puppets have in common?", "answer": "musician", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Where was John G. Young's alma later ranked in U.S. News & World Report's 2016 listing of top public liberal arts colleges?", "answer": "9", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the university established whose honor society is The Senior Skull Society?", "answer": "1865", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Grapico and R. White's Lemonade, are drinks?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the given name of the actor who established One Race Films ?", "answer": "Mark Sinclair", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2014-15 UMBC Retrievers men's basketball team were members of what Division 1 conference, whose members are located mainly in the Northeastern United States?", "answer": "America East Conference", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year did Jeff Green play for both Georgetown University and the Seattle SuperSonics?", "answer": "2007", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The CMLL 74th Anniversary Show included a cage match with which masked professional wrestler as part of the competition?", "answer": "M\u00edstico", "type": "bridge"}, {"quest