, what tropical storm caused significant flooding in eastern Texas and western Louisiana and also resulted in two deaths and damages totaling to $750 million?  ", "answer": "Tropical Storm Claudette", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Don Stark is an American actor known for his role as Bob Pinciotti on the Fox Network sitcom \"That '70s Show\" as well as on what American sports drama television series on VH1 series, created by James LaRosa?", "answer": "Hit the Floor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Supreme Court case was ruled on first; Glossip v. Gross or New Negro Alliance v. Sanitary Grocery Co.?", "answer": "New Negro Alliance v. Sanitary Grocery Co.", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Beautiful Garbage World Tour was the third world concert tour cycle by American/Scottish alternative rock group Garbage, an American alternative rock band formed in Madison, Wisconsin, in what year?", "answer": "1993", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the first episode of the fifth season and the 81st overall episode of the American animated television sitcom \"SpongeBob SquarePants\" where Sirena Irwin voiced Mama Krabs?", "answer": "Friend or Foe", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of bands are The Operation M.D. and Tuscadero.", "answer": "rock band", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Aristocats and The Odd Life of Timothy Green, have which organization in common?", "answer": "Walt Disney", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Donington le Heath Manor House Museum It was once owned by a relative of one of the group of provincial English Catholics led by who?", "answer": "Robert Catesby", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Nefarious Realm includes articles with models from the website founded in 2001 by whom?", "answer": "Selena Mooney", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of a former Soviet and current Ukrainian pop singer that created the album Canadian Tour 1983?", "answer": "Sofia Rotaru", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "T