ble for the album This Is Our God, was founded in what year?", "answer": "1983", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Have Gareth Evans and Tobe Hooper both worked on Academy Award nominated films?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Abar Bochhor Tirish Pore was organized in part in memory of an Indian Bengali singer, songwriter, bassist, and composer, who co-founded what progressive rock band?", "answer": "Moheener Ghoraguli", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is a game published by Machine Zone in the same year as new installments of \"Assassin's Creed\", \"Bomberman\", \"Call of Duty\", and \"Crash Bandicoot\"?", "answer": "Final Fantasy XV: A New Empire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Arthur Penn and Mick Jackson both film directors ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "This Is Spinal Tap co-starred which actor known for his voice work on The Simpsons?", "answer": "Harry Julius Shearer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which child of writer Loudon Snowden Wainwright Jr spent time performing in Greenwich Village? ", "answer": "Sloan Wainwright", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 47th Mr. Olympia competition was run by a Convention Center owned and operated by who?", "answer": "Las Vegas Convention and Visitors Authority", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The irish folk group that collaborated on Celtic Woman: A Celtic Family Christmas was formed in what city?", "answer": "Dublin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the director of the 2010 American drama film starring the actor who played Dr. Emil Skoda in \"Law & Order\"?", "answer": "Marilyn Agrelo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What boxer who was born in 1966 was Pam Pinnock in an abusive relationship with?", "answer": "Mike Tyson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What genre is the Ron Howard film starring Catlett from the film \"Get Shorty\"?", "answer": "crime thriller", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In 2016, who published the first-person shoot