d Huazhou, Guangdong located?", "answer": "China", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was born earlier, Ricardo Iorio or Sarah Nixey?", "answer": "Ricardo Iorio", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Along with her song \"Will You Still Love Me tomorrow\" which made 76 on the Hot 100, Roberta Flack has also performed many duets, including \"Where Is The Love\" with which singer?", "answer": "Donny Hathaway", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which film is older, Snow Dogs or Prom?", "answer": "Snow Dogs", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which hospital, MedStar Washington Hospital Center or George Washington University Hospital, opened on August 23, 2002, with 371 beds?", "answer": "George Washington University Hospital", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which college has campuses in more countries, Northwestern University or University of California, San Francisco?", "answer": "Northwestern University", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which conference was convened by the Allied Powers of World War I after the Battle of Caporetto, which took place between 24 October to 19 November 1917?", "answer": "Rapallo Conference", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "While  Gymnocladus is a small genus of leguminous trees, what genus is Chrysogonum?", "answer": "genus of flowering plants", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Matt Skiba and Johnny Dean both musicians?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What novel features the historical period commonly described as occurring between 1947-1991?", "answer": "The Night of Wenceslas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Andr\u00e9 T\u00e9chin\u00e9 and Tim Burton both film directors?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What violinist made the 1996 classical music album playing musical works of he most celebrated violin virtuoso of his time, and left his mark as one of the pillars of modern violin technique ?", "answer": "Salvatore Accardo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question":