er of \"Shades of Cool\" born?", "answer": "1985", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was one of Dennis Edney's clients detained for ten years?", "answer": "Guantanamo Bay", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The village of Amissano is where an all-male academic institution was founded in what year?", "answer": "1930", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The character that Gavin Hammond voiced in Batman Begins first appeared where? ", "answer": "\"Detective Comics\" #27", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is Dane Bruckheimer's production company called?", "answer": "Annoying Orange, Inc.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which was established first, Presbyterian University College or National University of Singapore?", "answer": "National University of Singapore", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "\"Heffalumps and Woozles\" is a song from a full-length animated film distributed by who?", "answer": "Buena Vista Distribution", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Johanna Robbins is the winner of a 2010 300-lap super late model stock car automobile race held in what city and state?", "answer": "Pensacola, Florida", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which team defeated the 49ers by 34-31 in the 2013 Super Bowl?", "answer": "Baltimore Ravens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Mississippian stone statuary artifacts were produced near what modern city?", "answer": "St. Louis, Missouri", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of these genus produces flowers, Borago or Osteospermum?", "answer": "Osteospermum", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the name of the Brazilian-born, championship frontrunner who retired just before the finish line of the 2009 Valencia Street Circuit in Valencia, Spain?", "answer": "Bruno Senna", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Piper Perabo starred with Bruce Willis and Emily Blunt in this 2012 science fiction movie.", "answer": "Looper", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What profession do both Maria Bueno and Paul McNamee share?", 