016?", "answer": "Cartel Tijuana Nueva Generaci\u00f3n", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "25 Year Reunion Celebration is credited to the pop quartet originally formed in what city?", "answer": "Melbourne", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is native to Asia, Scopolia or Bellium?", "answer": "Scopolia", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was born first  Candice DeLong or Theodore John Kaczynski?", "answer": "Theodore John Kaczynski", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who has won the Miles Franklin Award three times and is frequently named as Australia's next contender for the Nobel Prize in Literature, W. E. B. Du Bois or Peter Carey ? ", "answer": "Peter Philip Carey AO", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Stephen Oremus was presented a Tony Award for \"The Book of Mormon\" during an award show in what theatre?", "answer": "Beacon Theatre", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is an evergreen, Sciadopitys or Tetrapanax?", "answer": "Tetrapanax", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what year was the college where Ole Edvart R\u00f8lvaag was a professor founded?", "answer": "1874", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What actor with Chaplinesque style on-screen movements and singing style starred in the film Naan Sollum Ragasiyam?", "answer": "J. P. Chandrababu", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What simulator ride at Universal Studios Florida, was one of the park's original attractions and later replaced by Jimmy Neutron's Nicktoon Blast?", "answer": "The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were Phillips v. Martin Marietta Corp. and New York Times Co. v. United States both Supreme Court cases?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the profession of the man with the initials A.S. that was portrayed on the BBC documentary Nuremberg: Nazis on Trial?", "answer": "architect", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the University, for which Joe Price played baseball in 1977, founded", "answer": "1