ndy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Bye Bye Man is a 2017 American supernatural horror film directed by Stacy Title, the film stars Cressida Curzon Bonas, an English actress, dancer and model, she's the youngest daughter of who?", "answer": "Lady Mary-Gaye Curzon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Laurens Vanthoor, is a Belgian professional racing driver, born on which date, currently racing for Porsche Motorsport, has been successful in many branches of motorsport of which most have been in long distance races?", "answer": "8 May 1991", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which board game won the \"GAMES Magazine\" award for \"Game of the year 2002\", Evo or Niagara?", "answer": "Evo", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which institution gives land, sea and space grants, the University of Maine, or the University of Houston?", "answer": "The University of Maine", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which rock group formed first, The Amps or Red House Painters?", "answer": "Red House Painters", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Where were the explosive components of the weapon that detonated on Nagasaki, Japan on 8/9/145 made? ", "answer": "The Salt Wells Pilot Plant", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Heisman winner did not have success at the professional level and is now a business owner in Oklahoma?", "answer": "Jason White", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actress that plays Abby Mills in \"Harper's Island\" also plays Amy Harris in a British series directed by who?", "answer": "Tom Grieves", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was one of the first English actress sex symbols to appear in the 8th annual TV Week Logie Awards?", "answer": "Pat Phoenix", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which game can be played by more than 2 players at a time, Game of the Generals or Ludo?", "answer": "Ludo", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Reichian therapy was created by the psychoanalyst who hailed from what country?", "answer": "Austrian", "type": "bri