rdshire, England, Hertfordshire Constabulary reported a planned fight at Holborn Stud Farm on Sunday, 26 October 1975, between which English millionaire, real estate investor, author and businessman from the East End of London, who was formerly a criminal and prisoner?", "answer": "Roy \u201cPretty Boy\u201d Shaw", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is Irish Michael Gambon or Viceroy's House? ", "answer": "Michael Gambon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What job does the man traded midseason in the 2011\u201312 Los Angeles Lakers to the Cleveland Cavaliers have with the Lakers?", "answer": "head coach", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "After suing Mark Zuckerberg, who started a digital currency exchange?", "answer": "The Winklevoss twins", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which has more species, Mussaenda or Sanguinaria?", "answer": "Mussaenda", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The A-Team film starsan American mixed martial artist who is a former UFC Light Heavyweight Champion, and as of July 2016, is signed to what fighting promotion?", "answer": "Bellator MMA", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What model/singer has covered the song \"Santa Maria\"?", "answer": "Samantha Fox", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2017\u201318 Serie B (known as the Serie B ConTe.it for sponsorship reasons) is the 86th season since its establishment in 1929, a total of 22 teams are contesting the league: 15 returning from the 2016\u201317 season, The 2016\u201317 Serie B, known as the Serie B ConTe.it for sponsorship reasons, and was the 85th season since its establishment in, what year?", "answer": "1929", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Standard Gravure shooting resulted in a high-profile lawsuit against which manufacturer of Fluoxetine?", "answer": "Eli Lilly and Company", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which country is the headquarters of the airline that Sempati Air had its IATA Code reassigned to?", "answer": "India", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What American crime drama started both Peter Riegert and Ewan McGregor?", "answer": "American Pastoral", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "James Roselle worked at WJTN in a town that had how many inhabitants at the 2010 Census ?", "answer": "31,146", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Hello Young Lovers, a show tune from 1951, used voice-over by an American sporano whose dubbong was used in what other films?", "answer": "\"The King and I\", \"West Side Story\", and \"My Fair Lady\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the actress from the CBS sitcom \"Good Times\" that starred in the film \"I'm Gonna Git You Sucka\" born?", "answer": "1938", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "what medical specialization was jonathan miller trained before he came to prominence with his role in \"beyond the fringe\" which was played at 1960 Edinburgh Festival in collaboration with jonathan miller and two others.", "answer": "training in medicine, and specialising in neurology", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Donna Edna Shalala currently serves as the president of a non-profit organization with offices located where?", "answer": "New York City and Little Rock, Arkansas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bull pipefish inhabits what  ocean basin and a marginal sea of the Atlantic Ocean, largely surrounded by the North American continent?", "answer": "Gulf of Mexico", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Monta Bell and Mack Sennett both directors?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Bob Lloyd began his ABA career with the team that later became the NBA team that competes in what Eastern Conference division?", "answer": "Atlantic Division", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which airport (Delta County Airport or Grand Canyon West Airport)  is closer to a nearby city?", "answer": "Delta County Airport", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The man responsible for the establishment of the airline that merged with Qantas in 1992 was born in what year?", "answer": "1878",