n Laika or the Sussex Spaniel, can be slow-paced, but can have a clownish and energetic temperament?", "answer": "The Sussex Spaniel", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was a bigger television writer, Danny Cannon or Tinto Brass?", "answer": "Danny Cannon", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What role did an actress who was in the 1973 American coming-of-age comedy-drama film co-written by George Lucas play in the sitcom \"One Day at a Time\"?", "answer": "Julie Mora Cooper Horvath", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The current number one song the the Hot Rap Songs chart was released by We the Best and Epic Records on what date?", "answer": "April 28, 2017", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which board game allows more players to play, Forbidden Island or Australia?", "answer": "Australia", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What daytime medical soap opera has an actor who has appeared in an Italian drama television series starring Jude Law?", "answer": "General Hospital", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What company located in Herzogenaurach, Bavaria uses Funda Onal as a model?", "answer": "Adidas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the bronze sculpture located that portrays America's first major prima ballerina, among others? ", "answer": "Tulsa, Oklahoma", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Unveiled in 1991, the Avalon was a concept vehicle does not appear to have any direct relation to the full-size car produced by Toyota in what country?", "answer": "United States", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which company overseeing projects like the Great Elephant Census had Jody Allen as its chief executive officer until 2015?", "answer": "Vulcan Inc.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In 1989, Larry Kinnebrew played for an NFL team who are the only NFL team to play their home games in what state? ", "answer": "New York", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Allegra Stratton has also co-presented \"Peston on Sunday\" with Robert Peston, the Business Edito