rummer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nickname of the challenger who at the K-1 World Grand Prix 2010 in Yokohama was defeated by Kyotaro Fujimoto?", "answer": "\"The Dutch Lumberjack\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "what city is agloves company based out of it is the 11th most populous municipality in the u.s. states of colorado.", "answer": "Boulder", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Golden Age of Murder is a book written by a British crime novelist, critic and what?", "answer": "solicitor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Ford Motor Company Edgewater Assembly Plant was located in the city along which river in New Jersey?", "answer": "Hudson River", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Michael Tighe has worked with which English singer-songwriter who had a contract by XL Recordings?", "answer": "Adele Laurie Blue Adkins", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jeff Skinner was selected seventh by the Carolina Hurricanes at this draft, held at the Staples Center in what city?", "answer": "Los Angeles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 1979\u201380 Colorado Rockies season was the franchise's fourth season in Colorado and their sixth in the NHL, trrying to jolt the fan base and create some excitement for the club, the team hired Don Cherry away from which organization?", "answer": "Boston Bruins", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who has more job titles, Marilyn Manson or Michael McKean?", "answer": "Marilyn Manson", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which novel tells a story about a wife of the founder of Islam?", "answer": "The Jewel of Medina", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of land vehicle is associated with the brands Field Marshall of Gainsborough, Lincolnshire and Track Marshall who produce earthmoving equipment and were active during WWII building tanks?", "answer": "tractor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Harpoon Brewery is an American brewery, as of 2013, it was the twelfth-largest craft brewery and 19th-largest over