inary Hill School was located in this community that hosts what airport?", "answer": "Lebanon Municipal Airport", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What character did the host of the Miss Teen USA 1998 pageant play in the TV series Saved by the Bell ?  ", "answer": "A.C. Slater", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of Banjo Paterson's most notable poems has been described as Australia's \"unofficial national anthem\"?", "answer": "\"Waltzing Matilda\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is another baseball team that Chaz Roe played for other than the Tampa Bay Rays based in St. Petersburg,  Florida?", "answer": "Arizona Diamondbacks", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the original nickname for the type of plane used in KLM Flight 861?", "answer": "Jumbo Jet", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the boxer who fought in the 2009 Fight of the year and retired from boxing in 2011?", "answer": "Juan D\u00edaz", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The fifth album of Adam Sandler feature the voice of which American actor, stand-up comedian, writer and television personality born on July 22, 1964?", "answer": "David Spade", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Grosvenor House is a twin tower complex in Dubai Marina in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, the complex, which is owned by Sheikh Ahmed bin Saeed Al Maktoum,   is president of the Dubai Civil Aviation Authority, CEO and chairman of which organization, chairman of Dubai World, and Noor Takaful insurance company?", "answer": "Emirates Group", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many campuses are in the University where Jim Bright works?", "answer": "seven", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what network does The Assistants and About a Girl air? ", "answer": "The N", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were Morris West and Tayeb Salih American writers?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the population of the city where Jimmy Foster is form?", "answer": "38,137", "type": "bri