ra", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What woman was featured in many of Diego Valazquez's painting such as \"Las Meninas\" as well as \"Infanta Margarita Teresa in a Pink Dress\"?", "answer": "Margaret Theresa of Spain", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which city in Tennessee, is the Seven Islands State Birding Park, that lies on the French Broad River, located next to?", "answer": "Knoxville", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Cho Kyuhyun and Layne Staley both singers?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Miss International 2008, the 48th Miss International pageant, was held on November 8, 2008 at The Venetian Macao in which autonomous region on the western side of the Pearl River estuary in East Asia?", "answer": "Macau", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Kieran Fleming was a member of the organization that wanted to remove Northern Ireland from what group?", "answer": "United Kingdom", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who produced the 1968 film that inspired the stage musical in which Hushabye Mountain is featured?", "answer": "Albert R. Broccoli", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the tenth episode of the American crime drama television series developed by Bruno Heller called?", "answer": "Lovecraft", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What documentary film used historical footage featuring the father of practical astronautics?", "answer": "Tank on the Moon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were Charles Gounod and Johann Christoph Pepusch from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In which county in Florida is the Euphorbia deltoidea indigenous?", "answer": "Miami-Dade County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Nehi and Grapico were both introduced in what years respectively? ", "answer": "1924", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who are the members of this band who wrote the music and lyrics for the musical \"Saturday Night Fever?\"", "answer": "Barry, Robin, and Maurice Gibb", "type": "bridge"}