d who died in the South of France?", "answer": "Glamis Castle", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is younger, Harry Daghlian or Zach Bogosian?", "answer": "Zachary M. Bogosian", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the top wind speed of the third cyclone to hit land in New York City?", "answer": "115 mph", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What female entrepreneur has often been quoted in Entrepreneur Media's magazine regarding her company, Warm Biscuit Bedding Company?", "answer": "Vicki Bodwell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The capital of Slovenia is located between which two cities", "answer": "Carniola and Styria", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When can the earliest records be found of \"London Bridge is Falling Down,\" the basis for Newtrament's record?", "answer": "seventeenth century", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which movie came out first, Rascal or The Parent Trap ?", "answer": "The Parent Trap", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what year was the artist that sang the song \"SuperLove\" born?", "answer": "1992", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What house servers as a museum and has held seances?", "answer": "Graceland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Reginald \"Reggie\" Carter, was an American basketball player, born in New York City, he played his schoolboy years starring for Long Island Lutheran High School, a Lutheran college preparatory school in which city in New York?", "answer": "Brookville", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are the Zeyrek Mosque and the Bayezid II Mosque located in different cities?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Before the advent of what was the prime example of a battle-axe a radical member of the temperance movement?", "answer": "Prohibition", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 1998 black comedy film was directed by Peter Berg?", "answer": "Very Bad Things", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Henry Septimus Beddome was an employee at Hudson's Bay Company but also a what?",