ied by Santino Rice has been filled by new additions, Santino Rice (born August 20, 1974) is an American fashion designer and television personality, best known for his appearance the show?", "answer": "seventh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "John O'Donnell worked for one year as the president and chief operating officer of a hotel and Casino designed by who ?", "answer": "Martin Stern, Jr.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The person Death-Throws was introduced as enemies of had what ranking in IGN's Top 100 Comic Book Heroes list?", "answer": "#44", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Michael Carrington is an American comic writer and voice actor best known for his work on which animated series, he did voicework, most notably as Sideshow Raheem (Krusty's militant black sideshow partner in the 1970s) in \"I Love Lisa\", the fifteenth episode of the series fourth season?", "answer": "The Simpsons", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Globe-News Center for the Performing Arts is a performing arts facility in downtown Amarillo, Texas, the building was constructed by the Dallas office of which American construction management firm based in Indianapolis, Indiana?", "answer": "Hunt Construction Group", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The voice of Tru Fax & the Insaniacs  band's lead vocalist, Diana Quinn, has been compared to what singer of the new wave band Blondie?", "answer": "Deborah Ann Harry", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Margaritaville\" is a 1977 song by a singer-songwriter with a base of fans known as what ?", "answer": "Parrotheads", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Isaac Liev Schrieber appeared in a 2010 American action thriller that was directed by Phillip Noyce, and was written by who?", "answer": "Kurt Wimmer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Laurie Metcalf voiced what character in a 1995 Pixar animated film? ", "answer": "Mrs. Davis", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the single-player campaign titled in the massively multiplayer, space tradin