fer to a region that falls entirely within which country, or a larger region divided between China and Russia?", "answer": "People's Republic of China", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " John Francis Daley played high school freshman Sam Weir on a show that aired during what television season?", "answer": "1999\u20132000", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were Herbert Achternbusch and Charles Barton both involved in film making?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which Queens rapper from the \"Product of the 80's\" compilation album became one the most successful rap duos in hip hop, having sold over three million records,Mobb Deep, Big Twins or Un Pacino?", "answer": "Mobb Deep", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the middle name of the actress who portrayed the main character in the film based on the first full-length biography of Ayn Rand? ", "answer": "Lydia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How tall (in meters) is the mountain which was named after a pilot from the airline based in Calgary, Alberta, Canada?", "answer": "1,750", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Matt Selman co-wrote the video game that was developed and distributed by which gaming company?", "answer": "Electronic Arts", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lim Ji-yeon made her feature debut in a film about a couple having a passionate affair in a military camp written and directed by who?", "answer": "Kim Dae-woo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Andrew \"Andy\" Holt is a fictional character from the British Channel 4 soap opera, \"Hollyoaks\", played by who?", "answer": "Warren Brown", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Whic dish originated in England and is served at many of chef Rick Stein's restaurants", "answer": "Fish and chips", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "During what season of the NBA did the Detroit Pistons move to Little Caesars Arena?", "answer": "72nd", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Juhi Parmar,  is an Indian TV personality and an anchor, actress, singer