er and David Siegel share?", "answer": "film director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who owns the wealth funds that Knut N. Kj\u00e6r was the manager of from 1997 to 2008?", "answer": "the government of Norway", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the English professional footballer born who plays as a winger for Premier League club Manchester United born who made Manchester United won the match 2\u20131 with goals?", "answer": "15 December 1992", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Todd Woodbridge and Luk\u00e1\u0161 Dlouh\u00fd, have which occupation in common?", "answer": "tennis player", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The journal Progress in Polymer Science is published and edited at which Pittsburgh university?", "answer": "Carnegie Mellon University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is situated in the City of Timmins, Ontario, Canada,  Dome Mine or Con Mine?", "answer": "Dome Mine", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which London Based accounting firm awarded a technology company based in Leuven, Belgium their company of the year award in 2005?", "answer": "Ernst & Young", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "La Boh\u00e8me included music sung by what English operatic tenor born in 1969", "answer": "Peter Auty", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ronald Jay Bath (born November 4, 1944) is a retired United States Air Force Major General who directed U.S. Air Force Strategic Planning for the service's Deputy Chief of Staff for Plans and Programs at service headquarters in the Pentagon, The United States Air Force (USAF) is the aerial and space warfare service branch of the United States Armed Forces and one of how many American uniformed services?", "answer": "seven", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Gianni Schicchi and Der Freisch\u00fctz both one-act operas?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which American gospel singer did David Huntsinger cowrite the song \"Holy Spirit, Thou Art Welcome\"?", "answer": "Dottie Rambo