e Magic Realism?", "answer": "Andrew Newell Wyeth", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what date did the invasion that the FUSAG was created to dsitract the Germans from occur?", "answer": "6 June 1944", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Tex and Condorman directed by the same cirector ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Hans F. Sennholz was a prolific author who studied under a theoretical Austrian School economist best known for his work on praxeology, a study of what?", "answer": "human choice and action", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What town is located within the North Coast region and on the Pacific Highway?", "answer": "Woolgoolga, New South Wales, Australia.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which year did the French economist, socialist, theoretician and politician, who was a great influence on the German philosopher, economist and revolutionary socialist Karl Marx, participate in the Revolution?", "answer": "1848", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Maynard James Keenan and Jo Kwon from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What song off of Taylor Swift's album to be released on November 10, 2017 samples the melody from \"I'm Too Sexy\" by the band Right Said Fred?", "answer": "Look What You Made Me Do", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which year did the song Skin released in 2010, was apart of the Loud Tour set?", "answer": "2011", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Today with Des and Mel was a British television series hosted by, Des O'Connor and which English television and radio presenter, and model, best known for co-hosting \"Today with Des and Mel\"?", "answer": "Melanie Ann Sykes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Omar Fadel's award winning composition can be found in the 2012 dark British satire film directed by what director?", "answer": "Larry Charles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the man who described Richard Paul Ashcroft as \"the best singer in the world\" 