inders are in the engine of the hatchback revealed by Honda at the 1997 Tokyo Motor Show?", "answer": "inline-four cylinder engine", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the Field Marshal in the Wehrmacht of Nazi Germany during World War II died who was first issued Commando Order on 21 July 1942?", "answer": "24 February 1953", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between Hahm Eun-jung and John Rzeznik, who has more diverse job experiences?", "answer": "John Joseph Theodore Rzeznik", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How many times did \"Daddy\" or \"Podge\" Hughes play for the cricket team representing all of Ireland?", "answer": "thirteen times", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On March 11, 2013 what did an artists' community located on a 400 acre estate in Saratoga Springs become designated as, who had a guest that is a playwright born in Roanoke, Virginia who began writing in elementary school, and graduated from New York University Tisch School of the Arts Undergraduate Film Program and Graduate Dramatic Writing Program? ", "answer": "National Historic Landmark", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which company is headquartered in San Francisco and invested in by Jeff Clavier?", "answer": "Fitbit", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who made a translation in 1859 of a work translated by Hemendra Kumar Roy into Bengali?", "answer": "Edward FitzGerald", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What actor in \"The Godfather\" was once up for a part in the remake of Ben-Hur?", "answer": "Marlon Brando", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The B46 bus route in Brooklyn, New York City, United States, runs to what shopping center opened in September of 1970?", "answer": "Kings Plaza", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Encore was released 8 years to the day after the album that was released by which company?", "answer": "Web Entertainment", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which was climbed first Nangpai Gosum or Dhaulagiri?", "answer": "Dhaulagiri", "type": "comparison"}, {"que