tle character in 2017 English-language French 3D science fiction adventure film written and directed by who?", "answer": "Luc Besson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Danish footballer performed a brace in the 1996 Scottish Cup Final?", "answer": "Brian Laudrup", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Roxanne Quimby, is an American artist, conservationist and businesswoman notable for founding which North Carolina-based personal care products company with the eponymous beekeeper, Ingram Berg \"Burt\" Shavitz, was an American beekeeper and businessman notable for founding which personal care products company?", "answer": "Burt's Bees", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Gifted is the third studio album by American rapper Wale, In 2008, Wale signed with Interscope Records for $1.3 million, and his debut album \"Attention Deficit\" was released in which year?", "answer": "2009", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which writer is American, Lu Xun or Annie Proulx?", "answer": "Edna Ann Proulx", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "what historic building in Washington, D.C. is located near the canal who's primary cargo is coal", "answer": "a historic building in the Georgetown section of Washington, D.C. located at 1066 Wisconsin Ave., NW", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What movie is based on a book that has been released in both Hebrew and Japanese?", "answer": "The Mortal Instruments: City of Bones", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Alloxylon and Leycesteria native to the same area?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What man born in 1836 was both the grandson and father of U.S. Senators?", "answer": "Eugene Hale", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Hanging Gardens collaborations from which artist that performed under  the name \"Senior\", Jeppe was the lead vocalist of the pop duo Junior Senior?", "answer": "Jeppe", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What genre of games are Torres and Balderdash?", "answer": "board game", "type": "comparison"}, 