ere the same year?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What actor born on September 7, 1982 was a star of the science fiction film MindGamers?", "answer": "Antonia Campbell-Hughes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Crazy, Stupid, Love, is a 2011 American romantic comedy film directed by Glenn Ficarra and John Requa, starring which Canadian actor and musician?", "answer": "Ryan Thomas Gosling", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Peter Riegert is best known for his role as newspaper editor Delbert McGinty in a family comedy-drama film loosely based on a memoir by who?", "answer": "Benjamin Mee", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which tennis player is from the United States, Robert Seguso or \u0141ukasz Kubot?", "answer": "Robert Arthur Seguso", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which region has a larger population, Guangshui or L\u00fcshunkou District", "answer": "L\u00fcshunkou District", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Ocean's Eleven was a remake of the film that was based on entertainers from what city?", "answer": "Las Vegas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The World Fellowship Center is east of the summit in what New Hampshire landform?", "answer": "White Mountains", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the inaugural champion of the WWN Championship?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What school of composers was attended by the composer whose operas were considered the only German ones more important than \"Die Soldaten\" by Bernd Alois Zimmermann?", "answer": "Second Viennese School", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the exact birth date of the other SNL cast member besides Luke Knoll that was born in the 1990's?", "answer": "November 16, 1993", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who published a young adult high fantasy novel by Sarah J. Mass?", "answer": "Bloomsbury", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Finding of Moses is a painting by an artist trained at what school?", "answer": 