ed by the show that ran for 3 seasons on what kids' TV network?", "answer": "Nickelodeon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which hospital has more beds, Providence Hospital or Psychiatric Institute of Washington?", "answer": "Providence Hospital", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what city were the Track Marshall brand of earthmoving equipment manufactured?", "answer": "Gainsborough, Lincolnshire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "High Strung is a 2016 American drama film starring what British actress, model and ballerina?", "answer": "Sonoya Mizuno", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where dod tje Hong Kong film director, who redid the 1946 American Christmas fantasy comedy-drama film produced and directed by Frank Capra, attend college?", "answer": "Kwun Tong Maryknoll College", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which country is the home of Mount Keith Mine, and the world's largest mining company which operates it?", "answer": "Australia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What portrays events set in the same fictional universe as an earlier work, usually chronologically following the events of that work., and is what  a Spanish comedy-drama television series produced by Bamb\u00fa Producciones for Movistar is to \"Velvet\"?", "answer": "A sequel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the film Mo about Mo Mowlam?", "answer": "Philip Martin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What entity initially owned and operated what is now called Legends Resort & Country Club?", "answer": "Playboy Enterprises", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What actor is related to the former CEO of the Nine Network and starred in the 1987 film With Love to the Person Next to Me?", "answer": "Kym Gyngell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the rapper, born in 1968, who collaborated with Duke Montana from?", "answer": "Corona, Queens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What firm helped design the major city of Suntec located in Marina Centre?", "answer": "Tsao & McKown Ar