r": "Eugene", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What programs of study does the Nova Law Review cover in its tri-annual publication for it's university?", "answer": "The university offers professional degrees in law, business, osteopathic medicine, allopathic medicine, allied health, pharmacy, dentistry, optometry, physical therapy, education, occupational therapy, and nursing.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Amir Sultan was captured by which Turco-Mongol conqueror?", "answer": "Timur", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year did the monarch Theresa may is \"collectively accountable\" to ascend to the throne?", "answer": "1952", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Stuart Diver was the sole survivor of the 1997 Thredbo landslide that occurred in what country?", "answer": "Australia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What should you do to show respect when walking the trail Oahu trial that leads to a 150 foot waterfall, on the night of Kane, Ku, Lono, or Kanaloa at sunset and just before the sunrises?", "answer": "lie face down", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What area does Salt Creek Falls and Multnomah Falls have in common?", "answer": "River", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "FPT University and Cavite State University Rosario Campus are both what types of facilities?", "answer": "university", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Where did one of Greg Bautzer\u2019s famous clients build hotels?", "answer": "Las Vegas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Mathew Waters played the role of Young Peter Allen in a musical that premiered in Australia in what year ?", "answer": "1998", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the 4.2 acre public garden in the Smithsonian complex, adjacent to the Smithsonian Castle on the National Mall in Washington?", "answer": "Enid A. Haupt Garden", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which national park is in more provinces, Caba\u00f1eros National Park or Timanfaya National Park?", "answer": "Caba\u00f1eros National Park"