ludes a cover of the song by which pop and euro disco group?", "answer": "Boney M.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Rakaposhi and Yukshin Gardan Sar located in the same country?", "answer": "Karakoram mountain range in Pakistan", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who wrote a biography of the jazz musician that lived his adult life as a man, but was assigned female at birth?", "answer": "Diane Helen Wood Middlebrook", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How long did it take to write the album \"Physical Graffiti\"?", "answer": "over a period of three years", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Fl\u00e1vio S\u00e9rgio Viana has a nickname given in reference to the goalkeeper who won what year's Euro Championship?", "answer": "1980", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Aspidistra and Brachyglottis, have which genus in common?", "answer": "flowering plants", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "\"(You Drive Me) Crazy\" is a song recorded by American singer Britney Spears, it was featured on the soundtrack of the 1999 teen romantic comedy film \"Drive Me Crazy\", a teen romantic comedy based on the novel \"How I Created My Perfect Prom Date\" by Todd Strasser, released in which year?", "answer": "1999", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 1998 British film, directed by Marc Evans was based on an Ulster loyalist gang ,many of whom were members of the Ulster Volunteer Force,?", "answer": "Resurrection Man", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what reality show did the actress appear who played the mother of Naira in a Hindi language television drama that premiered on January 12, 2009?", "answer": "Bigg Boss", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the first name of Elfriede Geiringer 's husband's elder brother ? ", "answer": "Robert", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which genus contains more species, Calendula or Heliotropium?", "answer": "Heliotropium", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Carlsberg Group brews what beer that was originally made by Nobertine mon