o released the album Eric the Pilot ?", "answer": "Henry Lawrence Garfield", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Chinese novel was the inspiration for the franchise where Sean Schemmel had his most famous or notable voice role?", "answer": "Journey to the West", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Chris Kirkpatrick was a founding member of which famous American boy band?", "answer": "NSYNC", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Also known as Earl Dibbles Jr, who released his debut album, Remington, on March 4, 2016?", "answer": "Granger Smith", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which University was founded first, University of the Aegean or Victoria University of Wellington?", "answer": "Victoria University of Wellington", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who has more experience in the film industry Ivan Magrin-Chagnolleau or Greg Mottola?", "answer": "Ivan Magrin-Chagnolleau", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who directed the 2014 French-American crime-thriller film in which Hailee Steinfeld portrayed Zooey Renner? ", "answer": "McG", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Miniat\u00fcrk and Aynal\u0131kavak Palace located in the same country?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The writer and driecter of \"Antarctic Journal\" also worked on a 2014 film starring which two actors?", "answer": "Jung Woo-sung and Esom", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the director of the 2013 American biographical sports film, starring the actor who played James Brown in \"Get on Up\"?", "answer": "Brian Helgeland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Welshly Arms is a band from Cleveland, Ohio, whose music was featured in American revisionist Western mystery film released in what year?", "answer": "2015", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the film Kim Hyang-gi starred in that was released in 2017?", "answer": "Lee Na-jeong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What actress from 2015 film \"The Rumperbutts\" is also known for roles on \"Pretty Little