ich film based on the 1991 novel \"The Feather Men\" starred Matthew Nable?", "answer": "Killer Elite", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bigelow Preserve is home to the lake in what counties in Maine?", "answer": "Somerset County and Franklin County,", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Jeff Buckley and Cave In both from the United States?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which city located near the confluence of the Mississippi and Chippewa Rivers was the setting for a 2010 documentary film on domestic violence?", "answer": "Wabasha, Minnesota", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A Danish actress born 14 February 1978 was in a french Fantasy and romantic drama film. Who was the director of that film?", "answer": "Luc Besson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What other band did guest drummer Brad Wilk, from \"Late Night with Seth Meyers\" also play with?", "answer": "Rage Against the Machine", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the uncle who played for the Phoenix Cardinals of the running back who set the NCAA freshman rushing record with 1,925 yards as a true freshman during the 2004 season?", "answer": "Ivory Lee Brown", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What group recorded a popular song that was featured on The Goonies?", "answer": "Goon Squad", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which film is a silent documentary film who was edited by a woman, 'Laloorinu Parayanullathu' or 'Man with a Movie Camera'?", "answer": "Man with a Movie Camera", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Fawad Khan has starred in Numm and also won numerous awards including 6 what?", "answer": "Hum Awards", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Loudoun Kirk is a disused church located about one mile west of a castle from which century ?", "answer": "19th-century", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the German pilot that built Udet U 1 born? ", "answer": "26 April 1896", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which band formed first, School of Fish or The Tears?", "answ