"}, {"question": "The Marine Air Terminal (\"Terminal A\"), located at where, which is an airport in the northern part of the New York City borough of Queens in the United States?", "answer": "LaGuardia Airport", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is a genus of tree, Vallea or Conospermum?", "answer": "Vallea", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How many episodes does the show with a character called Jillian Belk have?", "answer": "86", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who recorded both \"If You've Got Trouble\" and \"Anthology 2?\"", "answer": "The Beatles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Zaluzianskya and Carthamus native to the same parts of the world ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What project did an American aerospace engineer, test pilot, United States Air Force pilot, and one of the seven original astronauts, also referred to as the Original Seven or Astronaut Group 1, participate in?", "answer": "Project Mercury", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the director of the 2014 Tollywood romantic comedy produced by Manchu Vishnu which starred a Canadian born actress born in 1981 who was a former pornstar?", "answer": "G. Nageswara Reddy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the population of the town where Joy Far is?", "answer": "2,502", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What manufacturer was founded by the husband of Moya Lear?", "answer": "Lear Jet Corporation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which building, a former schoolhouse, is part of a historic district in downtown Cincinnati, bounded by 3rd, 5th, Sycamore, Commercial Sq, and Butler Sts.", "answer": "Guilford School", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What profession does Frank Pierson and Istv\u00e1n Szab\u00f3 have in common?", "answer": "director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which actress appeared in both the 2013 film Zombie Night and the 1998 thriller Wild Things?", "answer": "Jennifer Taylor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Peter Schreyer