 together on Hope for Haiti Now to create this song?", "answer": "Stranded", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Vyacheslav Kotyonochkin directed what Soviet/Russian animated series produced by Soyuzmultfilm?", "answer": "Nu, pogodi!", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the actor in the British crime drama, Mind Games, and in the \"Harry Potter\" films.", "answer": "Fiona Shaw", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the star of the movie filmed in Docklands Studios Melbourne, Australia for which Andrew Jackson was the visual effects supervisor in 2009?", "answer": "Nicolas Cage", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What does Countee Cullen and P. G. Wodehouse are famous for writing?", "answer": "novels", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of this English football former football player and co-owner of Salford City, who was drafted, along with his brother, for the 1995-96 Manchester United F.C. season?", "answer": "Philip John Neville", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Five Candles was used in a Michael Keaton film who stars who as the female lead ?", "answer": "Kelly Preston", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the famous wall of which in turn overlooked by Schloss Laufen am Rheinfall railway station?", "answer": "Switzerland, Europe", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year did the Supreme Court Justice who convicted the Tarzan Burglar begin serving?", "answer": "2009", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Minshull Vernon is a civil parish in which unitary authority area with borough status in the ceremonial county of Cheshire, England?", "answer": "Cheshire East", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Fran\u00e7ois Girard starred in a series of vignettes about the life of a pianist particularly renowned as an interpreter of the keyboard music of who?", "answer": "Johann Sebastian Bach", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Hellbilly Deluxe 2 World Tour was a worldwide concert tour by which American rock musician, filmmaker and screenwriter,