 senior of Manchester United's youth teams and the club's former reserve team?", "answer": "1 February 1971", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What band did one of the stars of Hitmaker sing in?", "answer": "Drug Restaurant", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In the 12th installment of the X-Men series, John Brolin is cast to first appear as which character?", "answer": "Nathan Summers / Cable", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the founder of an animation studio which cooperated with Marvel Animation to created a micro-series based on comics in 2010?", "answer": "Phil Roman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Top Thrill Dragster was surpassed in 2005 as the world's tallest roller coaster by a roller coaster located in which city ?", "answer": "Jackson, New Jersey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the major shopping mall which Bayshore station is located at located ", "answer": "Ottawa, Ontario, Canada", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Apollo 13, released in which year, is an American space adventure docudrama film directed by Ron Howard, the film depicts Fred Haise, an American former NASA astronaut, fighter pilot with which U.S. organization, and the U.S. Air Force and test pilot,?", "answer": "Marine Corps", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which group has the greater number of members, Fatherson or TISM?", "answer": "TISM", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what erotic romatic drama, starring Dakota Johnson and directed by James Foley, did Robinne Lee act?", "answer": "Fifty Shades Darker", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Japanese entertainment company made a videogame that is unrelated to the Christian-themed \"Super 3D Noah's Ark game for Super Nintendo Entertainment System?", "answer": "Konami", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Amigasa J\u016bbei is a television program that depicted stories of an 18th-century historical event in Japan in which a band of \"r\u014dnin\" (leaderless samurai) avenged the death of their master and wha