ia does and have in common?", "answer": "film", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between Ben Folds Five and Ra Ra Riot, which band has more members?", "answer": "Ra Ra Riot", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What 1977 Woody Allen film appears on GamesRadar's 50 Best Sex Comdies list?", "answer": "Annie Hall", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sophie Rois appeared in this 2001 French-American war film written and directed by who", "answer": "Jean-Jacques Annaud", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where did one of the advocates of the cobordism hypothesis teach mathematics?", "answer": "University of California, Riverside", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The book Medicine River was adapted into a movie that starred what Canadian-born Metis actor and singer who was the Chancellor of Trent University from 2009 until 2013?", "answer": "Thomas Dale Jackson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Simone Simons and Roger Taylor songwriters ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The actor who starred in \"Three Socks\" and \"Hustle\" also starred in a miniseries with Anglea Bassett that is set in what city?", "answer": "London", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What sport did George McCartney and Roy Keane both play?", "answer": "football", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What song by the Lovebugs and was the Swiss entry to the 54th edition of the annual Eurovision Song Contest?", "answer": "The Highest Heights", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who were the founders of the multinational corporation venture capital conglomerate for which David Baxby was formerly Co-CEO?", "answer": "Sir Richard Branson and Nik Powell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the world premiere of the 2016 film in which American actor Parker Sawyers appeared as Mr Lee?", "answer": "the Los Angeles Film Festival", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The play of which the title of \"Me! I'm Afraid of Virginia Woolf\" is a parody was first staged in what year?", "answ