xture of advocaat and lemonade in approximately equal parts, Black Russian or Snowball ?", "answer": "Snowball", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Stephanie Lee has had a role in the SBS drama series that aired for how many episodes?", "answer": "18", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The G. Heileman Brewing Company was acquired by Pabst Brewing Company through the purchase of what company?", "answer": "Stroh Brewery Company", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which cocktail has the least amount of ingredients, Mai Tai or Amber Moon?", "answer": "Amber Moon", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Julieta Ortega is the daughter of Palito Ortega, considered one of the main Argentine representatives of the musical style called what?", "answer": "New wave", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bruce Bilson is the grandfather of the actress who landed the role of whom in the drama \"The O.C.\"?", "answer": "Summer Roberts", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " in a 2016 comic book film Cara Jocelyn Delevingne played a fictional character created by who?", "answer": "Bob Haney and Howard Purcell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the score of the National Football League (NFL)'s champion Green Bay Packers first overall Super Bowl victory since the Orange Bowl?", "answer": "35\u201321", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Caba\u00f1eros National Park and Tablas de Daimiel National Park are located in what country?", "answer": "Spain", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Orchard Square, a small open-air court shopping centre, contains a privately held fast food franchise which is called what?", "answer": "Subway", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine, WomenSports or I Confess, was the first magazine dedicated to women in sports?", "answer": "womenSports", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Prospects is a British television comedy drama series with a character played by an English actor best known for his rolle of Ben in what BBC television sitcom?", "answer": "