": "bridge"}, {"question": "Q: Whivh Italian-Austrailian man born on August 6, 1955 was known as a close associate of ALphonse Gangitano?", "answer": "Domenic \"Mick\" Gatto", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Illusion was a song that was played at the Eurovision contest held in what most populous city in Russia?", "answer": "Moscow", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which musical, written by a French-born composer, is written for thirteen percussionists?", "answer": "Ionisation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is a martial art from Hawaii Charles Gaylord or Kajukenbo?", "answer": "Kajukenbo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Simon Christopher Danczuk, is a British former politician and Member of Parliament (MP) for Rochdale (2010 to 2017), Danczuk co-wrote a book about which former British Liberal Member of Parliament (MP) for Rochdale, abuse of children, and campaigned about historical allegations of child sex abuse?", "answer": "Cyril Smith", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Owen Wilson, who played in the movie \"Father Figures\" earned a nomination for the Academy Award for Best Original Scrrenplay for what movie?", "answer": "The Royal Tenenbaums", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What American rock band's ex-drummer was David Grohl?", "answer": "Nirvana", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which friend and tactical confidant of Ronald Sidney Maurice Reynolds was ranked as the greatest player in Spurs history?", "answer": "Danny Blanchflower", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which state held a by-election in 1979 for the Australian House of Representatives?", "answer": "New South Wales", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What occurred first, the Battle of Stadtlohn or the birth of Johann Tserclaes?", "answer": "Johann Tserclaes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Okchai are a Muscogee tribe, they formed part of the former Creek (Muscogee) Confederacy in which U.S. state, prior to the Indian removal, during the 1830s to the Indian Territory?", "answer": "Ala