erican sitcom Retired at 35, was born on what day?", "answer": "born February 13, 1934", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In 2010, what was the population of the city where deSoL is based?", "answer": "16,116", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Les Mistons (\"The Mischief Makers\") is a short film directed by Fran\u00e7ois Truffaut in 1957, in 2013 the Museum of Modern Art in New York City screened this film together with Truffaut's \"The 400 Blows\", a French drama film, the debut by director Fran\u00e7ois Truffaut, released in what year?", "answer": "1959", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of publication does Elle and Godey's Lady's Book have in common?", "answer": "magazine", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What company issued the 2 Chainz album that includes the song \"It's a Vibe\"?", "answer": "Def Jam Recordings", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Airline Deregulation Act of 1978 removed who's control over areas as fares, routes and market entry of new airlines?", "answer": "U.S. Federal Government", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What kind of music does Andy Williams' Greatest Hits and Moon River have in common?", "answer": "song", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The song \"Living Better Now\" is by Eric Marlon Bishop also know as who?", "answer": "Jamie Foxx", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What position did the man associated with the \"Jackass\" franchise play in the making of the Loiter Squad?", "answer": "executive producers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Most Excellent Order of the Golden Ark is a Dutch order of merit established by a prince born in which year ?", "answer": "1911", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Khady Sylla and Gy\u00f6rgy P\u00e1lfi from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Senecio and Furcraea are both a genus of what?", "answer": "plants", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Satellites & Sirens ia a band formed in 2006 on which American classified advertisements we