n who signed to WWE and who's manager was William Alvin Moody?", "answer": "March 24, 1965", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Tim Meadows, a guest star of Tween Fest, is one of the longest-running cast members of which show?", "answer": "Saturday Night Live", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which genus, Tuberaria or Dacrydium, is a genus of about 12 species of annual or perennial plants in the rockrose family Cistaceae?", "answer": "Tuberaria", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "United Lincolnshire Hospitals are located in Grantham in what country?", "answer": "England", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which city will you find the MTR or Mass Transit Railway which stops at Tin Yuet () which is located at ground level at the centre of Tin Shing Road and between Tin Yuet Estate and Tin Ching Estate?", "answer": "Hong Kong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born first, Patricia Hoskins or Jackie Stiles?", "answer": "Patricia Hoskins", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many people does the company brewing Denmark's most well-known beers employ?", "answer": "41,000", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the birth year of the founder of the spiritualistic philosophy codified in the 19th century?", "answer": "1795", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Mitchell Reiss worked for for this retired United States Air Foce lieutenant general, born in 1925.", "answer": "Brent Scowcroft", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Indian film actress, Kriti Kharbanda, stars in Minchagi Nee Baralu, but she made her acting debut what 2009 Telugu film?", "answer": "with the Telugu film \"Boni\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who founded the music group that performed \"Whiskey on My Breath\"?", "answer": "Stephen Barker Liles, Eric Gunderson, and Brian Bandas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was  American television personality which returned wth Brooke Burke Charvet as host in Season sixteen of \"Dancing with the Stars\"  born", "answer": "May 6, 1955", "type": "