ch company? ", "answer": "Warner Bros. Entertainment, Inc.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Mino Caprio, is an Italian actor, he is the official Italian dub voice for celebrities like Martin Short, a Canadian-American actor and comedian, and he is known for his work on the television programs \"SCTV\" and which TV program?", "answer": "Saturday Night Live", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What university founded in 1911 does Professor Albert Chen belong?", "answer": "University of Hong Kong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who wrote and produced the 1973 hit single from the album Desolation Boulevard?", "answer": "Nicky Chinn and Mike Chapman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Adam Smoluk and Mickey Rooney of the same nationality?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "International Tamizhan is the upcoming second album of which Indian music duo, consisting of Adhi and Jeeva?", "answer": "Hiphop Tamizha", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What film based off a novel by Frederick Forsyth did Nicholas Young star in?", "answer": "The Day of the Jackal", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " What is the name of the singer in the English Rock band formed in 1968 who released a double live album in November 2017 by Rhino Record?", "answer": "Jon Anderson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Dirty Dancing, an American reality television series, is hosted by an American actor and choreographer known for his brief marriage to whom?", "answer": "Jennifer Lopez", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the English professional football referee born who refereed The 2016 FA Cup Final?", "answer": "13 March 1975", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the mountain building period, that ended 440 million years ago and affected most of modern-day New England, first described?", "answer": "described it in the 1950s", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the Korean movie Scandal Makers?", "answer": "Kang Hyeong-cheol", "type": "bridge"}, {"question":