 type of university are both University of Massachusetts Lowell and New Mexico State University?", "answer": "research", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the military power's name formed by the new government of the soviet Union and fought in the the Soviet-Japanese border conflicts among the Soviet Union, mongolia, japan and Manchukuo  in 1939?", "answer": "Red Army", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was Collin Klein's official team color in 2009?", "answer": "Royal Purple", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Missin U has a sample of which song by an American jazz rock band founded by Walter Becker and Donald Fagen?", "answer": "\"Third World Man\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actress born Uma Devi Khatri stars with Madhubala andPradeep Kumar in what 1956 Indian film?", "answer": "Raj Hath", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " \"Cedars of Lebanon\" is the eleventh and final track on their 2009 album \"No Line on the Horizon\", the twelfth studio album by what Irish rock band?", "answer": "U2", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What county is Ave Maria University located within?", "answer": "Collier County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what date did the channel, which the show \"Yo, Guillermo\" is broadcast on, begin broadcasting?", "answer": "August 6, 2007", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Anthony Dirrell is the brother of which super-middleweight title holder?", "answer": "Andre Dirrell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What did Michael Alford serve as, as part of the ISAF force against a known Taliban stronghold and center of opium production?", "answer": "official War Artist", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What member of the Count Basie Orchestra recorded a 1957 album?", "answer": "Harry Edison", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who did the founder of Project RAND view as his own person \"troubleshooter\" while serving as general of the Air Force?", "answer": "St. Clair Streett", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Little Monster