ear was the Under Secretary of the Air Force replaced by a former member of the United States House of Representatives?", "answer": "2017", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the Japanese remake \"Lucky Key\" directed after Lee Gae-byok'S 10 year break?", "answer": "South Korea", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Reunion, released in which year, an American action film, starring Boyd Holbrook, an American actor and fashion model?", "answer": "2011", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed The Marrying Kind that featured the actress known for her role on \"The Beverly Hillbillies\"?", "answer": "George Cukor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What did a college  basketball player from Belmont University accomplish with the now professional basketball player for the Oklahoma City Thunder?", "answer": "Co-Player of the Year", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Hans Simonsson and Julie Halard-Decugis both from Sweden?", "answer": "No.", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What occupation do American producer Norm Green and Indian American screenwriter M. Night Shyamalan share?", "answer": "director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What type of land mass was discovered in 1513 by a Spanish explorer, governor, and conquistador?", "answer": "isthmus", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the album that the song \"Happy\" was on primarily recorded?", "answer": "Nellc\u00f4te, France", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Legend of Lobo and Ice Princess, are of which nationality? ", "answer": "American", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "When was the American professional basketball player born who announced that he would leave the Thunder and sign with the Golden State Warriors?", "answer": "September 29, 1988", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the date of birth of the coach of the 1981 Sooners football team?", "answer": "Barry Switzer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Kentucky Fried Movie was directed by what American directo