 Frith write for?", "answer": "Heat", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the man who is featured in the song \"Rockstar 101\", by Rihanna?", "answer": "British-American guitarist Slash of the rock group Guns N' Roses.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What part of the country of Argentina is San Julian Bay located?", "answer": "Patagonia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which queen is the first cousin of the princess that opened the Lakeside Shopping Centre in London?", "answer": "Queen Elizabeth II", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the inaugural winner of the Grammy Award for Best Rap/Sung Collaboration in 2002 and had worked with Mark Jenkins?", "answer": "Eve", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Ralph Bakshi and Herschell Gordon Lewis both American?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what year was the winner of the 1970 Pau Grand Prix born?", "answer": "1942", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Just Wright starred an American rapper who was born in Newark, and signed with what record label in 1989?", "answer": "Tommy Boy Records", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the director of the film with alternate title Coldwater?", "answer": "Canadian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Hongshao rou or red braised pork, a classic pork dish from mainland China, cooked using pork belly and a combination of ginger, garlic, aromatic spices, chilli peppers, sugar, and rice wine, as well as which light and dark liquid condiment,  made from a fermented paste of soybeans, roasted grain, brine, and \"Aspergillus oryzae\" or \"Aspergillus sojae\" molds?", "answer": "Soy sauce", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the comedian that uses one-liner jokes and was born on September 15?", "answer": "James Anthony Patrick Carr", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Petronella Oortman's dollhouse inspired the 2014 novel \"The Miniaturist\" while it was on display where?", "answer": "at the Rijksmuseu