s the park that contains Jumpin' Jellyfish?", "answer": "72", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the King of Norway from 1957 until his death died who was awarded Holmenkollen Medal in 1968?", "answer": "17 January 1991", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sir Oliver Bury Popplewell chaired the inquiry into a stadium fire that killed how many people?", "answer": "56", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the urban area where the Miss Universe 2013 pageant was held?", "answer": "Krasnogorsk Urban Settlement", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What NFL Comeback Player of the Year, 2001 was featured on the cover of  what video game?", "answer": "Madden NFL 99", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which member of India's pop band Euphoria appeared in the film \"Filhaal...?\"", "answer": "Palash Sen", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Behind an Australian-American mathematician who has worked in various areas of mathematics and who else is a Romanian child prodigy in mathematics the third youngest gold medalist in IMO history ?", "answer": "Ra\u00fal Ch\u00e1vez Sarmiento", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which film looked at life in Brazil's slums, Favela Rising or Burma VJ?", "answer": "Favela Rising", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Toy Story 3 and Mary Poppins both Walt Disney movies?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "About which singer is the film in which Sylvie Testud  appeared in 2007 ?", "answer": "\u00c9dith Piaf.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Christian groups belonging to the church communities of Anabaptist denominations named after Menno Simons, did a Canadian novelist and short story writer write of?", "answer": "Mennonites", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What date did the American global music corporation release the song which was the 2017 Eurovision Song Contest representative of Slovenia?", "answer": "8 April 2017", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which drink contained dichlorodiphenyltrichlo