fessional wrestler and actress April Hunter, who costars in the 2006 film Just Another Romantic Wrestling Comedy?", "answer": "Joanie Laurer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Armor Games hosts free browser games for a wide variety of genres, what is the name of the platform used for production of animations, rich Internet applications, desktop applications, mobile applications, mobiile games and embedded web browser video players?", "answer": "Adobe Flash", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Tom and Jerry: A Nutcracker Tale is loosely based on a story by a man who had what nationality? ", "answer": "German", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What band performed a song released in September 1989 as the second single taken from their self-titled debut album of the same name written an an American songwriter who rose to prominence in 1983, and has since written songs for and with multiple music artists, as well as for several films?", "answer": "Bad English", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Kelli Ali and Justin Currie, share which occupation?", "answer": "singer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which collaborator of Luke Reynolds was best known for her contributions as a member of The New Pornogrophers?", "answer": "Neko Case", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What metropolitan statistical area is the Hungerford Vocational Highschool located in?", "answer": "Orlando\u2013Kissimmee", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Old Tung Chung Pier at the mouth of the Pearl River is located on the largest island in what city?", "answer": "Hong Kong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The RL-83 Blindicide was produced by Mecar SA of Belgium and was an improved derivative of what man-portable recoilless anti-tank rocket launcher weapon, widely fielded by the United States Army?", "answer": "Bazooka", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lt Tamara Fyodorovna Konstantinova was a pilot of a ground-attack aircraft of which how many units were produced during the war?", "answer": "36,1