rd game, Medici or Titan?", "answer": "Medici", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Is Mark Krikorian responsible for the immigration of Harout Pamboukjian?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Joey Miyashima is a Japanese American television and film actor who played Oki Doki, the pen pal of a comic fictional character created and portrayed by what American comedian?", "answer": "Paul Reubens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was Joey Cramer's most notable film released?", "answer": "1986", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the music played by the Canadian band Martyr a subgenre of?", "answer": "death metal", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between David Vincent and Eddie Vedder, who had a more diverse musical career?", "answer": "Eddie Vedder", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What stands amoung the Froze-to-Death Mountain and is located in the U.S. state Montana?", "answer": "Beartooth Mountains", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Mauro Ranallo was a Showtime broadcaster for the bout that was known as what?", "answer": "The Money Fight", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Calvin Valentine is a fictional character from the British Channel 4 soap opera, \"Hollyoaks\", played by Ricky Whittle, Calvin appeared again as a ghost to tell his wife and Theresa's sister Carmel McQueen, played by which former English actress, model and yoga teacher, born on 6 February 1984?", "answer": "Gemma Anna Merna", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which English rock ban from Abingdon, Oxfordshire, covered \"No Surprises\" from American singer-songwriter, Blake Morgan's 2006 album \"Silencer\".", "answer": "Radiohead", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Balsamorhiza and Moltkia flowering plants?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What type of series was the 2010 series which starred a Hong Kong actress born in 1970?", "answer": "drama series", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lloyd Raymond Cardwell, was an American 