n series \"Raw\"?", "answer": "Anand Tucker", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What movie was designed by Fran\u00e7ois Audouy and directed by James Mangold?  ", "answer": "The Wolverine", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the Editor-in-Chief of the newspaper that is sponsoring Aman ki Asha (Hope for Peace) initiative?", "answer": "Mir Shakil-ur-Rahman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What theater named after an animal does Olympia Entertainment manage?", "answer": "Fox Theatre", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which tennis player has retired, Hank Pfister or Maria Sharapova?", "answer": "Hank Pfister", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": " Adam Carroll currently races for a previously Formula One constructor that competed in the FIA Formula One what?", "answer": "World Championship", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is a recurring fictional character in the animated television series \"The Simpsons\" in the episode where he  builds a Christian-themed amusement park to commemorate his dead wife?", "answer": "Nedward \"Ned\" Flanders, Jr.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What prison is the Cleveland Strangler incarcerated at?", "answer": "Chillicothe Correction Institution", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What show did Chuck Woolery host 1 year before hosting the game show \"Think like a Cat\"?", "answer": "\"Lingo\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Rose and Millettia are both members of what family?", "answer": "Fabaceae", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Daviesia and Iresine, both a genus of flowering plants, in the same family?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "YM and The Believer, are which form of publication?", "answer": "magazine", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The next woman elected to Congress from massachusetts after the defeat of Margaret Heckler belongs to what political party?", "answer": "Democratic Party", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When are Multekrem and the traditional Danish wreath cake ge