ress in what show?", "answer": "Barney & Friends", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Rome & Jewel stars which American actress who is also a character on True Blood?", "answer": "Lindsey Haun", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which country was Pilot Officer Sydney \"Timberoes\" Carlin fighting against while serving as air gunner?", "answer": "German Air Force", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Equinox, founded by Aleister Crowley was considered to be a?", "answer": "poet", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Richard Roma is a fictional character from David Mamet's 1982 play \"Glengarry Glen Ross\" and its 1992 film adaptation, Glengarry Glen Ross is a play by David Mamet that won the Pulitzer Prize in which year?", "answer": "1984", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How is the city pronounced in Tamil that Kanniyakumari railway station serves?", "answer": "'Kan-niya-kumari'", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the founder of Curtiss-Wright born?", "answer": "1886", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What record company released the first single off the album Ol' Waylon?", "answer": "RCA Victor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What position does Igor Jelavi\u0107's nephew usually play? ", "answer": "winger", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Shakespeare play features contrast and mockery?", "answer": "Sonnet 130", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which 2010 war thriller based on a non-fiction book was directed by Paul Greengrass?", "answer": "Green Zone", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When the city was the capital of Georgia where John Milledge Academy campus is located on?", "answer": "1804 to 1868", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Along what river is the city in the area of Interstate 395?", "answer": "Penobscot River", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " East and West is a 1998 book by crossbench member of the British House of Lords since what year?", "answer": "2005", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was featured in the second-best selling 