ced the mother, Hill was an English actress and operatic soprano, who remains best known for her role as Madame Fanny La Fan in the British television series \"'Allo 'Allo!\"?", "answer": "Samuel Beckett", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which trail about 3000 mi long and established in 1912, was in direct competition with Pikes Peak Ocean to Ocean Highway?", "answer": "National Old Trails Road", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Grave Misconduct is a 2008 thriller film starring an American actress best known for her  seven-year-long role on what sitcom?", "answer": "Wings", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "From what arena does sports broadcaster Phil Chenier broadcast from?", "answer": "Capital One Arena", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who had a more eclectic set of jobs in entertainment, Neil Jordan or George Schaefer?", "answer": "Neil Patrick Jordan (born 25 February 1950) is an Irish film director, screenwriter, novelist and short-story writer.", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Omar Sharif, who starred in the 1997 indie comedy film, Heaven Before I Die, won how many Golden Globe Awards?", "answer": "three Golden Globe Awards", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of a traditional healer who treated the West Ham United right back from Argentina?", "answer": "Serbian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Kentucky Democratic Presidential Primary took place on which date, the winner in each of Kentucky's six congressional districts was awarded all of that district's delegates, totaling 34?", "answer": "May 20, 2008", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "in 2010, Lyman High School was ranked as the 204th best high school in the united stated by a weekly magazine founded in which year ?", "answer": "1933", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Kara Louise Tointon, is an English actress, and is known for playing who, in the ITV live production of \"The Sound of Music Live\"?", "answer": "Maria", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Zwan and Noir D\u00e