ond Time Around is a film starring what actress and Cantopop singer?", "answer": "Cecilia Cheung Pak-Chi", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Yang Yun-ho film received a nomination at the ceremony also known as Daejong Film Awards?", "answer": "\"Fighter in the Wind\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Yasser Al-Shahrani of Al-Hilal, and Barcelona's Lionel Messi, both appear on the cover of the FIFA 16 game that's sold in which global region?", "answer": "Middle East", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Marvelettes was an American girl group that achieved popularity in the early- to mid-1960s, and were the first major successful act of Motown Records after the Miracles and its first significantly successful girl group after the release of which 1961 number-one single, a song written by Georgia Dobbins, William Garrett, Freddie Gorman, Brian Holland, and Robert Bateman?", "answer": "Please Mr. Postman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is a Chinese documentary, Umbrella or Saigon, U.S.A.?", "answer": "Umbrella", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Seven of Nine is portrayed by which German actress?", "answer": "Jeri Lynn Ryan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birthday of the composer of the song \"Cups\" that wasn't Luisa Gerstein?", "answer": "December 15, 1891", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which college is in the US, Universiti Tunku Abdul Rahman and Lawrence Technological University?", "answer": "Lawrence Technological University", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How many universities are included with Zhejiang University in the official alliance which produces 20% of the nations academic publications and 30% of total citations in China?", "answer": "an official alliance of nine elite and prestigious universities", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The woman that anchored \"Our World\" with Ray Gandolf was a Washington, D.C. correspondent for what network?", "answer": "NBC News", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What tribe is the 