ighway on the east coast that crosses into Georgia from Florida at what point?", "answer": "St. Marys River near Kingsland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Since 2005, who has represented the constituency which Richard Godson was a member of Parliament from 1831-32?", "answer": "Anne Main", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Stephen H. Hess held a position at the research university in what city?", "answer": "Washington, D.C.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the other film about Christine Chubbuck besides Kate Plays Christine at the 2016 Sundance Film Festival?", "answer": "Antonio Campos", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The third studio album by the band Bury Tomorrow is named after a type of poem that list the letters of what type of alphabets?", "answer": "runic", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Dog the Bounty Hunter is a show that chronicles which bail bondsman?", "answer": "Duane Lee \"Dog\" Chapman I.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Giovanni Santi was the father of which Italian architect of the High Renaissance?", "answer": "Raffaello Sanzio da Urbino", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "American television comedy series \"Getting On\" stars this American actress born in 1955 who appeared on ABC sitcom \"Roseanne\" (1988\u201397) as what character?", "answer": "Jackie Harris", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "For which international team did Paul Ramsey, a former professional footballer who played in a defensive midfield role, play during the 1986 FIFA World Cup which was held in Mexico?", "answer": "Northern Ireland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This poet was a mastery of the dramatic monologue who had art songs written to him by David Mills.", "answer": "Robert Browning", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which play by William Shakespeare did  Jeremy Irons appeared in", "answer": "The Winter's Tale", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birth date of the person who built Rodoni Castle?", "answer": "6 May 1405", "type": "bridge