n?", "answer": "1965", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How far back does the residence of Hector Mor Maclean of Dowart date?", "answer": "13th century", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who took Trevor Knight's starting position at quarterback on the Oklahoma Sooners college football team in the 2015 season?", "answer": "Baker Mayfield", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Phil Rosen and Paul Bogart American film directors?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Long Pursuit is a 1967 novel about the escape of survivors from what battle where the Empire of Japan invaded the British stronghold of Singapore?", "answer": "The Battle of Singapore", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which university Gregory Stephen Jerman represented as member of BU in the 1998 NCAA Division I-A football season?", "answer": "Baylor University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which premiered first, the TV series Eden of the East or the movie Mary and Max?", "answer": "Mary and Max", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What TV show's fifth season did the man who has earned more number-one albums than any other artist in US jazz chart history guest star on?", "answer": "Will & Grace", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 1952 Australian Championships was held at a venue named after a drive that seperates it from what river?", "answer": "River Torrens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is this Danish charter airline headquartered in Copenhagen which resulted from merging of two airlines and operates at Copenhagen Kastrup Airport?", "answer": "Thomas Cook Airlines Scandinavia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was an American actor and musician, Bob orton Jr. or Barry Orton?", "answer": "Barry Orton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the largest city in the county containing the majority of SR 37?", "answer": "Lakeland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What party is the governor who Karen Jackson served as Deputy Secretary of Technology under?", "ans