te the Dr. Izzie-focused episode \"Time Has Come Today\"", "answer": "Shonda Rhimes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birthdate of this American singer-Songwriter, who released the album Dance, along with Lindsey Buckingham, Mick Fleetwood, Christine McVie, and John McVie?", "answer": "May 26, 1948", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Documentary Short, Youth in Crisis or  Primary ?", "answer": "Youth in Crisis", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "When was the older brother of \"Malcolm Subban\" born?", "answer": "May 13, 1989", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the football club for which Edgaras Mastianica most recently played founded? ", "answer": "1933", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The sitcom \"Drake & Josh\" could be found on a television network that was launched when?", "answer": "December 1, 1977", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of the historical crime drama television series on which Charlie Murphy will appear was created by Steven Knight and produced by Caryn Mandabach Productions and Tiger Aspect Productions?", "answer": "Peaky Blinders", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Re-Constriction Records was a division of Cargo Music based in California, the label was founded in which year, and headed by Chase, who was previously the Music Director at KCR, a student radio station on the campus of San Diego State University?", "answer": "1991", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which state in the Pacific Northwest region on the West coast of the United states  has the Schinia vacciniae?", "answer": "Oregon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which dog breed is more rare, The Stabyhoun or The Norwich Terrier?", "answer": "The Stabyhoun", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "This urban park was used as a cemetery by a city in in North West England which with its surrounding areas is the fifth largest what in the UK?", "answer": "metropolitan area", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which year did the town where Ernest Leopold Sichel was born become a municipal borough?", "answer": "1847", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which actress had a recurring role on a Comedy Central situational comedy television series?", "answer": "Jillian Bell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What television show ran for 39 episodes from 1998 to 2000 on the ABC starred an actress who is one of only two actresses to win two Australian Film Institute Awards in the same year?", "answer": "SeaChange", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which team that Chris Iannetta played for has never won a division title?", "answer": "The Colorado Rockies", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of this centre-left political party in the United Kingdom, in which Gavin Shuker serves as the Chair?", "answer": "Co-operative Party", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the English name for the country which housed the Kampfbund in the 1920s?", "answer": "Germany", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which band debuted an album first, Black Kids or Cave In?", "answer": "Cave In", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who composed Khandana Bhava\u2013Bandhana based on tintal a prayer song with simple rhythmic structure?", "answer": "Swami Vivekananda", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are George Seaton and Apichatpong Weerasethakul both American?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What casino is connected by tram to the hotel that featured the free show Sirens of TI?", "answer": "The Mirage", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which director is also a screenwriter, Randal Kleiser or Jos\u00e9 Bohr?", "answer": "Jos\u00e9 Bohr", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Near what trail is a lake Rangeley Lake  flows into?", "answer": "Appalachian Trail.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What song, by English singer, songwriter and model born 22 August 1995, was written by Caroline Ailin, Emily Warren and Ian Kirkpatrick?", "answer": "New Rules", "type": "bridge"}, {"que