hat?", "answer": "Tupperware Corporation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What album by They Might Be Giants has the same name as an African American folk hero?", "answer": "John Henry", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the state in which one of the Quill Foundation's supporters is located?", "answer": "Michigan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The South Tongu District is one of the twenty-five (25) districts in the Volta Region, South Tongu, is the administrative centre of which capital of South Tongu district, a district in the Volta Region of Ghana?", "answer": "Sogakope", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are John Crowley and Katharine Kerr both Americans ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Garcia J\u00fanior is known as the voice of which alter ego of Prince Adam?", "answer": "He-Man", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who starred in Jo Jin-kyu's 2016 film \"Sweet Sixteen\"?", "answer": "Joo Won", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is a type of cactus, Austrocylindropuntia or Spathiphyllum?", "answer": "Austrocylindropuntia", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the population in 2010 of the city which the radio station KFXS is licensed to serve ?", "answer": "67,956", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " James Reid last played for a minor league ice hockey team that has won four what?", "answer": "post-season championship titles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ruki Vverh! is a band that has which Russian musician as the lead?", "answer": "Sergey Evgenevich Zhukov", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "H.A.M.M.E.R. is a fictional espionage and law enforcement agency appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics and was formed in \"Secret Invasion\" #8 to replace S.H.I.E.L.D., created by what two men? ", "answer": "Stan Lee and Jack Kirby", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "So Appalled features verses by which hip hop artist from Stone Mountain, Georgia?", "answer": "Cyhi the Prynce", "type": "bridge"}, {"qu