orter of a leading figure of the Mexican Revolution and main leader of the peasant revolution in the state of Morelos witness when he was seven years old?", "answer": "a worker shot dead", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2011 Major League Soccer All-Star Game, held on July 27, 2011, was the 16th annual Major League Soccer All-Star Game, a soccer match involving all-stars from Major League Soccer, Manchester United won the game 4\u20130 with goals, including which English professional footballer who plays for Premier League club Arsenal and the England national team?", "answer": "Daniel Nii Tackie Mensah Welbeck", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the ethnicity of both The Kid with the 200 I.Q. and Robert Guillaume?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Denham Fouts was the inspiration for characters by the writer and intellectual of what nationality?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the Australian opera singer appearing on The Dangerous Liaisons born?", "answer": "1960", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Wrist serves as the second single from what mixtape released July 1 2016", "answer": "Bobby Tarantino", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The African oriole is a resident breeder in a desert with an area of what?", "answer": "9200000 km2", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the current athletic director of where Jenny Rowland was on the women's gymnastics team?", "answer": "Joe Castiglione", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This American comedy film starred Steve Martin, Diane Keaton and a Canadian-American actor who won what award in 1999?", "answer": "Tony Award", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What debut studio album features a musician who won a Glastonbury Talent Competition in 2015?", "answer": "What Do You Think About the Car?", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the team from Arizona in the division where the 2007 Seahawks won the division title?", "answer": "Cardinal