?", "answer": "\"Chuck\" Jones", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was won more awards, Asghar Farhadi or Peter Cattaneo?", "answer": "Asghar Farhadi", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Where was the footballs stadium at which Redskins' first season located? ", "answer": "Landover, Maryland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which drama series \"Cedar Cove\" actress stars in a movie that follows the adventures of Charles Grant and his circle of friends?", "answer": "Andie MacDowell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 2007 American psychological horror film did a Golden Globe Award nominee for High Fidelity star in?", "answer": "1408", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "WHen did the film convicted in 1984 and sentenced to life in prison plus 50 years for murdering her daughter premier?", "answer": "12 November 1989", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Kevin Callahan is currently the head coach at a private university located in what city?", "answer": "West Long Branch", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The husband of Elma Yerburgh was the M.P. for a constituency created in what year?", "answer": "1545", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "which films has the highest numbers of stars Davy Crockett and the River Pirates: or A Bug's Life:", "answer": "A Bug's Life", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Ashton Chen played one of  Ip Man's students in a martial arts film directed by who ?", "answer": "Wilson Yip", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Don Orsillo, was then hired by the San Diego Padres to replace broadcasting legend Dick Enberg upon his retirement at the end of which year's season?", "answer": "2016", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "General Mills, Inc. markets this advertising campaign created by the Washburn-Crosby Company in which year?", "answer": "1921", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "You Ask Me To, is a song written by Billy Joe Shaver and Waylon Jennings, Shaver recorded his own version in 1977, for the album \"Gypsy Boy\", with which American musi