y Payton's final full season with the Seattle SuperSonics basketball team presently coach?", "answer": "Indiana Pacers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Colonel Joesph Hardin, Sr. joined what group that was composed of American frontiersmen from west of the Appalachian Mountains who took part in the American Revolutionary War?", "answer": "Overmountain Men", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Annabeth Schott who was played by Kristin Chenoweth played in what movie? ", "answer": "The West Wing", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Nuruosmaniye Mosque and Bulgarian St. Stephen Church located in Germany?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What American actor, born on June 11, 1969, starred in The Angry Birds Movie?", "answer": "Peter Dinklage", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the Australian actress who starred with Kevin Bacon, Radha Mitchell, David Mazouz, Matt Walsh, Jennifer Morrison, Ming-Na Wen and Parker Mack in the film \"The Darkness\" born?", "answer": "1992", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Khwezi is a producer who has worked for an American rapper and singer from what city?", "answer": "Detroit, Michigan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actor that played the character Norman Pitkin also starred in a 1965 British comedy film directed by who?", "answer": "Robert Asher", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Southern rapper who was born in Durham, North Carolina, is famous for the song \"You're Everything\"?", "answer": "David Banner", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Girl Alone was sponsored by an American multinational food manufacturing company that produces cereal and convenience foods, and is headquartered where?", "answer": "Battle Creek, Michigan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which stadium does the defender Jack Hobbs play his home football matches in the Championship?", "answer": "the City Ground", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A Home in Indiana stars what Academy Award winning actor?", "answe