iginally formed first, Archers of Loaf or Tomahawk?", "answer": "Archers of Loaf", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Ekeino to kalokairi is a Greek version of the 1970 film written by whom?", "answer": "Erich Segal", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sgt. Herbert Bellerby was killed by a member of what country\u2019s Air Force?", "answer": "German", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the headquarters of the company that Frank Bisignano is Chairman and CEO of?", "answer": "Atlanta, Georgia, United States", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born earlier, Akim Tamiroff or Ernest H. Dervishian?", "answer": "Akim Mikhailovich Tamiroff", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Mark St. John did brief guitar work in 1984 with the American rock band from what city?", "answer": "New York City", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Angela Christian made her West End debut creating the title role in a Musical by Andrew Lloyd Webber which was based on a novel written by who", "answer": "Wilkie Collins", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine covers a wider array of interests, Electronic Design or Lapidary Journal Jewelry Artist?", "answer": "Lapidary Journal Jewelry Artist", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Afrophilya, is an international music festival founded in Montreal, Quebec, in which country, notable artists who have performed at the festival include South African Lorraine Klaasen daughter of Nelson Mandela's favourite singer Thandi Klaasen?", "answer": "Canada", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of sport does John Meechan and Burnley F.C. have in common?", "answer": "football", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who did the actor that plays Mark in \"The Room\" reunite with in Best Friends?", "answer": "Tommy Wiseau", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Alexander Hood was an officer of what naval warfare force that has origins in the early 16th century?", "answer": "Royal Navy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ireland has no formal honours sys