o known as what?", "answer": "The Atom", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is older, Margaret Landon or W. H. Auden?", "answer": "Margaret Landon", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What English actor performed in a show in which a family was transformed into the first vampires?", "answer": "Joseph Morgan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What marque of Toyota that expanded into Canada in 2010 had a concept car built by a company in Hunting Beach, CA?", "answer": "Scion", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of this American actor, voice actor, comedian, and producer, born in 1964, who was the voice of Bartok in Anastasia?", "answer": "Hank Azaria", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the artist who recorded the song \"Give it 2 U in which rapper Kendrick Lamar makes a guest appearance?", "answer": "Robin Thicke", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the person who played drums in the supergroup Planet Us?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The song \"Wild Horses\" was written by Birdy and a songwriter from what city?", "answer": "Derry", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is  an attraction located in of the many themed lands featured at all of the Magic Kingdom styled Disney theme parks that replaced an attraction called If You Could Fly?", "answer": "Walt Disney World Resort", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The manager from the 2012\u201313 AS Monaco FC season later became the head coach of what team?", "answer": "Nantes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which disciplined service, the first police agency to operate with a modern policing system in Asia, is lead by a person who reports to the Secretary for Security?", "answer": "Hong Kong Police Force", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "An Ideal Husband (German:Ein idealer Gatte) is a German comedy film, released in what year, directed by Herbert Selpin, it is based on the 1895 play \"An Ideal Husband\" by Oscar Fingal O'Flahert