uced which 2002 film directed by Andrew Lau and Alan Mak?", "answer": "Infernal Affairs", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the 2017 Indian Telugu language coming of age-black comedy drama film that stars Vijay Deverakonda?", "answer": "Sandeep Reddy Vanga", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between Haikou and Gaizhou, which city is located further south of China?", "answer": "Gaizhou", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "She Fell Among Thieves stars an actress who has worked consistently in theatre, film, and television since what year?", "answer": "1953", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The film Against the Sun stared stared which English actor?", "answer": "Tom Felton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which northwest Adelaide suburb, and birthplace of Mark Harrity the fast bowler, shares its name with a system of flag signalling?", "answer": "Semaphore", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "WABI-TV is presented to viewers by a national service carrier headquartered in which city?", "answer": "Meridian, Colorado", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What American rock band released the studio albums Angel Dust and Sol Invictus?", "answer": "Faith No More", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which film has more directors, Religulous or Gimme Shelter?", "answer": "Gimme Shelter", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who composed the popular song which peaked at No. 7 on the C&W Jockey charts and became a standard song about unrequited love", "answer": "Don Gibson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Social Suicide is a 2015 British romantic drama thriller which reunited Olivia Hussey and an English actor and singer touted as a star in the making, the next Laurence Olivier and the next what?  ", "answer": "great British actor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Alberta Agenda was published in the flagship paper of what group on January 27, 2001?", "answer": "Postmedia Network", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which  2016 best winning percentage in team history