ire's successor as the commander of the 617 Squadron?  ", "answer": "Tirpitz", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Shayn Solberg's best known character \"Spencer Martin\" was from the show Eureka that took place in what town?", "answer": "Eureka, Oregon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which actor on \"Gash\" was born on January 30, 1974?", "answer": "Olivia Colman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " The Mississippi Gulf Coast Open was played in a city located in which county ?", "answer": "Harrison County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Alexander Ludwig (born May 7, 1992) is a Canadian actor, singer and model, his notable film credits include, Race to Witch Mountain, a 2009 American science fiction adventure thriller film, and a remake of which 1975 Disney film?", "answer": "Escape to Witch Mountain", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What band formed in 1986 by lead vocalist and guitarist Billie Joe Armstrong and bassist Mike Dirnt, Green Day or The Servants?", "answer": "Green Day", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who wrote the original play that was inspired by a passion for a Vienne composer, and was the base for the opera Orpheus und Eurydike?", "answer": "Oskar Kokoschka", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Chuck E. Cheese's and Gino's East restaurant chains?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What unit sent detachments to the main theatre of war during the First World War?", "answer": "The 1st Durham Engineers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What industrial metal band formed in Sion, Switzerland in 1987, released an album named, \"Reign of Light\"?", "answer": "Samael", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which boxer was born first, Emmanuel Clottey or Joshua Clottey?", "answer": "Emmanuel Clottey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Pehchaan: The Face of Truth stars Vinod Khanna, Rati Agnihotri and which Indian actress, producer, and former model who also produced the film?", "answer": "Raveena Tandon", "type": "bridge"}, {"q