ho wrote the film in which Dane DeHaan plays James Dean?", "answer": "Luke Davies", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Sord Computer Corporation and Apple I both PC manufacturers?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What genre are both Splendora and Vertical Horizon?", "answer": "alternative rock", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Tania Saulnier is a Canadian actress, perhaps best known for her role in a 2006 American science fiction-comedy horror film that was the directoral debut of who?", "answer": "James Gunn", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Maya Kazan is the younder sister of an actress who portrayed Emily Gardner in what film?", "answer": "The Big Sick", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Phillips Berlina used stretched underpinings from a sports car that was produced during what years? ", "answer": "1968 through 1982", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 2013 Canadian romantic comedy film was starred in by an actress who debuted in Swordswallowers and Thin Men and also appeared in the Savages and Revolutionary Road?", "answer": "The F Word", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born first, Carl Wayne or Morten Harket?", "answer": "Carl Wayne", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is fictional, Rabo Karabekian or Karnig Sarkissian, or both?", "answer": "Rabo Karabekian", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who produced the single from Birdman that Jonathan Smith made a cameo appearance in the video?", "answer": "T-Mix", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where did the designer of products for a science fiction RPG published by TSR in 1998 serve as Director of Roleplaying Design and Development?", "answer": "Wizards of the Coast", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "George Oldroyd dedicated which composer to  Cosmo Gordon Lang?", "answer": "Mass of the Quiet Hour", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Russian mathematician was born the earliest, Nikolay Bogolyubov or Leonid Kantorovich", "answer": "Nikolay Nikolayevich Bog