", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "] Martin's Lie is a chamber opera in one act with music and an English language libretto by an Italian-American composer who kept his what?", "answer": "Italian citizenship", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In addition to his role in When Strangers Appear, what role did Barry Watson play in \"7th Heaven\"?", "answer": "Matthew \"Matt\" Camden", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How long is the race track that hosted the 1992 Italian motorcycle Grand Prix?", "answer": "5.245 km", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which genus has a smaller distribution, Barklya or Illicium?", "answer": "Barklya", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of the public research university established in 1963, where Kuan Hsin Chi was chairman?", "answer": "Chinese University of Hong Kong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Go Now became associated with an English rock band from what city? ", "answer": "Birmingham", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What character, created by Bob Kane and Bill Finger, was drawn by Jim Balent from 1993 to 1999?", "answer": "Catwoman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the address of the school that Victor Cesar Bota attended in the US? ", "answer": "2231 Prairie Avenue Miami Beach", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Was Atomic Ed and the Black Hole or Giuliani Time released first?", "answer": "Atomic Ed and the Black Hole", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Cierva C.8 was built by Juan de la Cierva in association with a company founded in what year?", "answer": "1910", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Red Mercury starred the English actor who also played whom in the Harry Potter series?", "answer": "Argus Filch", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Disney character is based on an A. A. Milne story?", "answer": "Winnie the Pooh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Stanislav Smirnov and Georgy Adelson-Velsky, were both what?", "answer": "mathematician", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Resident E