 Jeff Scott Soto?", "answer": "Jeff Scott Soto", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Throwim Way Leg is a book written by Australian zoologist and climate change activist Timothy Fridtjof \"Tim\" Flannery (born 28 January 1956) is an Australian mammalogist, palaeontologist, environmentalist and global warming activist, he was the Chief Commissioner of which organization, a Federal Government body providing information on climate change to the Australian public?", "answer": "Climate Commission", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many Grammy awards has the person who released Iconos in 2010 won?", "answer": "two-time", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country is home to both Don and Priyanka Chopra?", "answer": "India", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ron Carey, and Max Gail who played a character nicknamed Wojo, both appeared in which TV police drama?", "answer": "Barney Miller", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Of which nationality is the co-designer of the Sea Truck?", "answer": "British", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the father of one of the top fashion designer's who, along with Karl Lagerfel and Miuccia Prada, highly favored model Angela Lindvall?", "answer": "Paul McCartney", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Pumping Iron is a docudrama, released in what year, about the world of professional bodybuilding, with a focus on the 1975 IFBB Mr. Universe and 1975 Mr. Olympia competitions, the film also features segments on bodybuilder Francesco Columbu, an Italian actor, author, former champion bodybuilder and \"World's Strongest Man\" competitor?", "answer": "1977", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In 2014 Kamala Devi Harris was elected as what number Attorney General to serve California?", "answer": "32nd", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What underwater boat is fully autonomous and made by BAE Systems? ", "answer": "Talisman UUV", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Both Arthur T. Gregorian and Robert Nalbandyan belongs to which national?", "answe