sed on freedom of thought?", "answer": "Conscientious objection", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the man who sent three specimens of desert rat-kangaroo to John Gould born?", "answer": "1812", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What city does Thomas Keell and Freedom have in common?", "answer": "London", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What small town near the Pennies features the Facit railway station?", "answer": "Whitworth", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ngud is a song produced by a record producer who is presently signed to what record label?", "answer": "New Money Gang Records", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Zapotec left archaeological evidence near what present-day city?", "answer": "Oaxaca City", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "E. Howard Hunt and N\u00e2z\u0131m Hikmet both share the job title as being what?", "answer": "writer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "1962 film Big and Little Wong Tin Bar was the debut of which iconic martial artist, stuntman and actor?", "answer": "Jackie Chan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Friendly Persuasion lost out on an Academy Award to which song by Livingston and Evans?", "answer": "Que Sera, Sera", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is Dani Pinto's position for clubs Acad\u00e9mica de Coimbra, C.F. Uni\u00e3o de Coimbra, Leng Ngan, G.D. Negro Rubro, G.D. Lam Pak, Kuan Tai and F.C. Porto de Macau, before he became a coach for the four time defending champions of the league?", "answer": "defender", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Erica Cerra portrayed what in the American post-apocalyptic science fiction drama in 2014?", "answer": "A.L.I.E.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Superdrag and Tom Morello, are of which nationality?", "answer": "American", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The first major bay north of Sydney Harbour, encompassing Lion Island, is called what?", "answer": "Broken Bay", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was from a country closer to the United States of A